{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_014KqDdTJage7CTKH2JyqfsV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed imagined experiment results for the \"worst\" tier across all planned experiments in the experiment_plan. I need to carefully consider each experiment, the worst-tier assumptions (A1-A7), and the key metric ranges defined for this tier, then produce plausible but pessimistic results with rationales.\n\nLet me go through each planned experiment and generate worst-tier predictions.\n\nLet me list all planned experiments:\n1. probe-multiseed (status: planned, but registry shows PENDING with results - I'll still generate worst-tier predictions)\n\n\n2. cosinesim-check\n3. probe-002 (status: planned, but registry shows DONE - already has results)\n4. baseline-lf-oracle\n5. baseline-llm-judge\n6. baseline-meanpool-lr (DONE in registry)\n7. error-analysis\n8. cross-agent\n9. temporal-label-model\n10. flyingsquid-baseline\n11. outcome-bp-sensitivity\n12. ablation-window-size\n13. ablation-architecture\n14. ablation-lf-holdout\n15. ablation-supcon\n16. non-nlp-baseline\n17. encoder-ablation\n18. data-scaling\n19. early-termination-sim\n20. interpretability\n21. human-annotation\n22. lf-temporal-dynamics\n\nI need to be more careful here—the prompt specifically asks for planned experiments only, so I should filter out the ones already marked as DONE in the registry and focus on generating worst-case predictions for the remaining planned ones.\n\nLooking at the experiment_plan status field more carefully, I'm seeing some discrepancies where experiments are marked as planned but show DONE in the registry. Let me trace through which ones are actually planned: probe-multiseed, cosinesim-check, probe-002, baseline-lf-oracle, baseline-llm-judge, baseline-meanpool-lr, error-analysis, cross-agent, and temporal-label-model are the ones I need to focus on for detailed data generation.\n\nOnly emb-001 and probe-001 are marked as complete in the experiment_plan, so I need to generate worst-tier predictions for all the remaining experiments. Now I'm setting up the worst-case metric ranges based on assumptions A1 through A7 to establish baseline performance expectations. Looking at the performance metrics across different experimental conditions, I'm seeing the probe maintains reasonable performance on auto-labeled data even in worst-case scenarios, but the gold set evaluation reveals significant degradation. For the multi-seed probe specifically, the challenge isn't the auto-label performance itself—it's the stability and how well it generalizes to gold-standard annotations, particularly when dealing with confidence thresholds. worst tier, we might see higher variance:\n- mean_macro_f1: ~0.905 (on auto labels, similar to single seed)\n- std_macro_f1: ~0.018 (higher variance)\n- But more importantly, this doesn't tell us about gold set performance\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The registry already has probe-multiseed results. The experiment_plan says status: planned. There's a discrepancy. I'll treat it as needing worst-tier predictions.\n\nLet me be systematic about this. For the worst tier:\n\n1. **probe-multiseed**: Auto-label performance is similar to what we've seen (~0.90). The variance is moderate. But this doesn't save the paper because the real issue is gold set performance.\n\n2. **cosinesim-check**: The 0.3129 is confirmed as a bug or threshold issue. After fixing, cosine sim should improve to around 0.55-0.60, which would narrow the gap with probe somewhat.\n\n3. **probe-002**: Already complete with conf≥1 F1=0.8468. In worst tier, this actually demonstrates decent noise tolerance, though the gold set results will be the real test.\n\n4. **baseline-lf-oracle**: LF oracle performs strongly on auto test set (~0.88-0.92 on conf≥2), meaning probe barely exceeds or matches it. On gold set, probe ranges from -3 to +1 percentage points versus LF oracle.\n\n5. **baseline-llm-judge**: LLM judge with chain-of-thought reasoning achieves 0.82-0.88 macro-F1 on gold set, substantially outperforming probe's 0.68-0.76 range.\n\n6. **baseline-meanpool-lr**: Already complete. GRU outperforms meanpool by 4.8 percentage points.\n\n7. **error-analysis**: Probe's failures follow systematic patterns—it over-relies on certain labeling function signals and struggles with semantic stagnation cases.\n\n8. **cross-agent**: Probe's F1 drops to 0.55-0.65 across agents, while LF oracle degrades less severely, which undermines the transfer claims.\n\n9. **temporal-label-model**: The core assumption fails—temporal label model gains only 1-4pp over majority vote on gold and performs comparably or worse than FlyingSquid, so the method contribution doesn't hold.\n\n10. **flyingsquid-baseline**: FlyingSquid matches or exceeds temporal label model performance, which is the critical finding that breaks the paper's narrative.\n\n11. **outcome-bp-sensitivity**: Removing outcome_bp causes a 5-12pp F1 drop, indicating severe label leakage.\n\nThe ablations reveal that window size doesn't matter much, architectural choices are marginal, and the biggest vulnerability is the outcome_bp feature. Structural features alone get close to the NL embedding approach, encoder selection barely affects results, and the model saturates early on scaling. Early termination provides minimal practical savings, and interpretability analysis is still pending.\n\nLooking at the human annotation results, there's moderate agreement on what constitutes stagnation but the boundary itself is inherently fuzzy. The temporal dynamics in the labeling functions show some patterns, though FlyingSquid already captures most of the correlation structure.\n\nNow I'm constructing the full YAML output for all the planned experiments, being careful to distinguish between what's already completed in the registry versus what's still planned.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12805,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12805},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2a2c3b6b-be0a-4a84-a4c0-944524ebc718","uuid":"22067df5-e8b7-4c99-994b-45be3a1d471a"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_014KqDdTJage7CTKH2JyqfsV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  核心假设（temporal label model 作为方法论贡献）不成立。Temporal label model 对比 FlyingSquid 无显著优势（-2~+1pp），\n  说明 LF 相关性建模已足够，时序动态不能转化为标签质量增益。outcome_bp 泄露严重（hold-out 后 F1 下降 7-10pp），动摇标签可靠性。\n  Probe 在 gold set 上低于 LF oracle 或仅持平，student-exceeds-teacher 不成立。LLM-as-judge CoT 在 gold set 上\n  明确优于 probe（gap 5-8pp），probe 仅剩成本优势。Cross-agent 迁移退化严重（F1<0.65）。人工标注 κ<0.60 表明 stagnation\n  边界本身模糊。论文需从 method contribution 彻底 reframe 为 empirical study：(1) 系统性揭示 data programming\n  在 agent trajectory 上的 failure modes（i.i.d. 违反、LF 时序动态 characterization、outcome_bp 泄露量化）；\n  (2) stagnation taxonomy + window-level formulation 作为 task contribution；(3) GRU 时序建模在高噪声标签上的鲁棒性\n  作为实证发现。目标 Findings of EMNLP，预期 reviewer score 3.0-3.5。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"probe-multiseed\"\n    plan_id: \"probe-multiseed\"\n    description: \"多 seed 验证（seed=42,123,456）确认 gap 统计稳定性\"\n    expected_results:\n      mean_macro_f1_auto: 0.9025\n      std_macro_f1_auto: 0.0185\n      seed_42_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      seed_123_macro_f1: 0.8870\n      seed_456_macro_f1: 0.9150\n      all_seeds_above_070: true\n      all_seeds_gap_above_5pp_vs_repeat3: true\n      mean_macro_f1_gold: 0.72\n      std_macro_f1_gold: 0.031\n    result_rationale: >\n      在自动标签（conf≥2）上多 seed 表现稳定（std~0.019），gap vs Repeat-3 始终 >5pp——这不是问题所在。\n      问题在于一旦切换到 gold set 评估，三个 seed 均降至 0.69-0.75 区间（mean 0.72），暴露出 probe 在\n      conf≥2 上的高 F1 部分来自对 LF 噪声模式的 overfitting。Gold set 上 std 增大到 0.031，说明\n      模型在真实标签分布上不如在自动标签上稳定。这本身是一个有价值的实证发现——high auto-F1 不等价于 high gold-F1，\n      但作为方法贡献的支撑不够。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Multi-seed Stability (Auto Labels vs Gold Set)\"\n        columns: [\"Seed\", \"Auto Macro-F1\", \"Gold Macro-F1\", \"Gap vs Repeat-3 (auto)\", \"Gap vs LF Oracle (gold)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"42\", \"0.9055\", \"0.7380\", \"+6.2pp\", \"-0.8pp\"]\n          - [\"123\", \"0.8870\", \"0.6920\", \"+4.4pp\", \"-2.5pp\"]\n          - [\"456\", \"0.9150\", \"0.7250\", \"+7.2pp\", \"-1.2pp\"]\n          - [\"Mean±Std\", \"0.903±0.019\", \"0.718±0.031\", \"+5.9±1.4pp\", \"-1.5±0.9pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Box plot: 三个 seed 在 auto labels 和 gold set 上的 macro-F1 分布对比，清晰展示 auto→gold 的性能下降\"\n    analysis: >\n      多 seed 在 auto labels 上稳定（符合预期），但 gold set 上均值仅 0.72 且 variance 增大。\n      最关键的发现是 gold set 上 probe vs LF oracle 差距为 -1.5pp（mean），student-exceeds-teacher\n      claim 不成立。这意味着 probe 未能学到超越 LF 启发式的信号，只是以 neural 方式逼近了 LF 的判断。\n      对于 reframed paper，这转化为\"probe 在 noisy labels 上的鲁棒性\"实证发现——即使 gold-F1 不高，\n      它在 LF 不可用的推理场景下仍提供 0.72 的可用估计。\n\n  - name: \"cosinesim-check\"\n    plan_id: \"cosinesim-check\"\n    description: \"CosineSim baseline 排查：threshold 值、分数分布、确认 0.3129 是否合理\"\n    expected_results:\n      original_f1: 0.3129\n      issue_found: \"threshold miscalibration\"\n      optimal_threshold: 0.78\n      corrected_f1: 0.5820\n      distribution_overlap_ratio: 0.68\n    result_rationale: >\n      原始 0.3129 确实存在 threshold 问题——默认 threshold=0.5 在 embedding 空间中不合理，因为连续 step\n      的 cosine similarity 普遍较高（mean~0.85）。优化 threshold 后 F1 升至 0.58，但仍远低于 probe（0.90）\n      和 Repeat-3（0.84）。根本原因是 cosine similarity 衡量的是相邻 step 的表面语义相似度，而 stagnation\n      涉及 window 级别的 goal-directed progress，单步 cosine 无法捕获这个层次。分布分析显示 progress 和\n      stagnation 窗口的 mean cosine 分布重叠率 68%，说明这个特征本身区分度有限。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: CosineSim Threshold Sweep\"\n        columns: [\"Threshold\", \"Precision\", \"Recall\", \"Macro-F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0.50 (default)\", \"0.218\", \"0.875\", \"0.313\"]\n          - [\"0.70\", \"0.412\", \"0.723\", \"0.498\"]\n          - [\"0.78 (optimal)\", \"0.561\", \"0.608\", \"0.582\"]\n          - [\"0.85\", \"0.645\", \"0.391\", \"0.472\"]\n          - [\"0.90\", \"0.712\", \"0.198\", \"0.295\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Histogram: progress vs stagnation 窗口的 mean pairwise cosine similarity 分布，展示高度重叠\"\n      - \"Line chart: threshold vs F1 曲线，标注 optimal threshold 位置\"\n    analysis: >\n      修正后 CosineSim（0.58）仍是最弱 baseline，确认 semantic similarity ≠ progress。但修正本身\n      重要——论文中需报告 corrected 版本（0.58），否则 reviewer 会质疑 baseline 是否被刻意弱化。\n      在 reframed paper 中，这成为\"stagnation 不等于 repetition\"的实证证据。\n\n  - name: \"probe-002\"\n    plan_id: \"probe-002\"\n    description: \"全量数据训练（conf≥1, 54,809 windows）vs conf≥2 对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      conf1_auto_macro_f1: 0.8468\n      conf2_auto_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      delta_auto: -0.0587\n      conf1_gold_macro_f1: 0.735\n      conf2_gold_macro_f1: 0.720\n      delta_gold: +0.015\n      conf1_train_windows: 38161\n      conf2_train_windows: 10780\n      conf1_stagnation_f1: 0.7772\n      conf1_progress_f1: 0.9165\n    result_rationale: >\n      在自动标签上 conf≥1 比 conf≥2 低 5.9pp——符合预期，因为 conf=1 的标签噪声高（72% 的数据是\n      conf=1，LF 分歧严重）。但在 gold set 上反转：conf≥1 训练的 probe（0.735）略高于 conf≥2（0.720），\n      因为更大的训练数据量补偿了噪声。这是 worst tier 中少有的正面发现：GRU 对标签噪声具有鲁棒性。\n      结合 baseline-meanpool-lr 的结果（mean-pool 在 conf≥1 上降至 0.778，GRU 仍有 0.847），\n      GRU 时序建模在高噪声下的增量价值（+12.7pp vs mean-pool）成为可讲的实证贡献。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Label Noise Tolerance (conf≥1 vs conf≥2)\"\n        columns: [\"Training Set\", \"N_train\", \"Auto Macro-F1\", \"Gold Macro-F1\", \"Stag F1 (auto)\", \"Prog F1 (auto)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"conf≥2\", \"10780\", \"0.9055\", \"0.720\", \"0.859\", \"0.952\"]\n          - [\"conf≥1 (full)\", \"38161\", \"0.8468\", \"0.735\", \"0.777\", \"0.917\"]\n          - [\"Δ\", \"+27381\", \"-5.9pp\", \"+1.5pp\", \"-8.2pp\", \"-3.5pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: conf≥1 vs conf≥2 在 auto labels 和 gold set 上的 F1 对比，突出 auto→gold 反转\"\n    analysis: >\n      Auto-label 上 conf≥2 更优（数据干净），但 gold set 上 conf≥1 略好（数据量大）——这个反转\n      本身是有价值的发现。对于 reframed paper，这构成 \"probe robustness to label noise\" 的核心证据，\n      说明在弱监督场景下 GRU 的时序建模能从高噪声数据中提取有用信号。\n\n  - name: \"baseline-lf-oracle\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-lf-oracle\"\n    description: \"LF ensemble oracle baseline — 直接用 LF 实时输出做窗口级判定\"\n    expected_results:\n      lf_oracle_auto_conf2_macro_f1: 0.9450\n      lf_oracle_auto_conf1_macro_f1: 0.8200\n      lf_oracle_gold_macro_f1: 0.7450\n      probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.7200\n      probe_vs_lf_oracle_gold_gap_pp: -2.5\n      lf_oracle_coverage: 1.0\n      lf_oracle_conf1_accuracy: 0.62\n    result_rationale: >\n      LF oracle 在 conf≥2 auto labels 上 F1=0.945（接近天花板，因为 auto labels 本身就是 LF 投票生成的）。\n      在 gold set 上 LF oracle 达到 0.745，而 probe 仅 0.72——probe 未能超越 LF oracle（gap -2.5pp）。\n      这直接否定了 \"student exceeds teacher\" 的 claim。根本原因：在 worst tier 下，gold set 的标签\n      分布与 LF 投票结果高度一致（因为 human annotators 在模糊 case 上也倾向于与 LF 多数一致），\n      probe 没有额外信号来源，其泛化优势无法体现。LF oracle 在 conf=1 上仅 0.62 accuracy（随机猜测\n      级别），但 probe 在这些 case 上也未显著更好，说明 conf=1 的困难 case 对两者都是硬骨头。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Probe vs LF Oracle\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Auto conf≥2 F1\", \"Auto conf≥1 F1\", \"Gold F1\", \"Inference Time\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LF Oracle (MV)\", \"0.945\", \"0.820\", \"0.745\", \"~0ms (rule-based)\"]\n          - [\"LF Oracle (any-2)\", \"0.938\", \"0.795\", \"0.738\", \"~0ms\"]\n          - [\"Probe (GRU)\", \"0.906\", \"0.847\", \"0.720\", \"4.2ms\"]\n          - [\"Δ Probe vs MV Oracle\", \"-3.9pp\", \"+2.7pp\", \"-2.5pp\", \"+4.2ms\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Confusion matrix pair: LF oracle vs Probe 在 gold set 上的错误模式对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      Probe 未能超越 LF oracle 是 worst tier 的核心打击。然而，probe 在 conf≥1（LF 分歧严重区域）上\n      auto-F1 比 LF oracle 高 2.7pp——说明 probe 在 LF 不确定时确实提供了增量信号，只是这个增量不足以\n      在 gold set 上体现。Reframed paper 中将这个结果诚实报告为 \"probe approximates but does not exceed\n      LF oracle\"，转而强调 probe 在 LF 不可用场景（跨 agent、新 agent）的价值。\n\n  - name: \"baseline-llm-judge\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-llm-judge\"\n    description: \"LLM-as-judge baseline（Claude/GPT-4o, zero-shot + few-shot + CoT）\"\n    expected_results:\n      claude_zero_shot_gold_f1: 0.780\n      claude_few_shot_gold_f1: 0.820\n      claude_cot_gold_f1: 0.855\n      gpt4o_zero_shot_gold_f1: 0.765\n      gpt4o_few_shot_gold_f1: 0.808\n      gpt4o_cot_gold_f1: 0.840\n      probe_gold_f1: 0.720\n      probe_vs_best_llm_gap_pp: -13.5\n      probe_vs_llm_cot_gap_pp: -5.5\n      llm_cost_per_window_usd: 0.032\n      probe_cost_per_window_usd: 0.000052\n      cost_ratio: 615\n      llm_latency_ms: 2800\n      probe_latency_ms: 4.2\n      latency_ratio: 667\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLM-as-judge（特别是 CoT variant）在 gold set 上明确优于 probe。Claude CoT 达到 0.855（vs probe 0.72，\n      gap -13.5pp vs zero-shot, -5.5pp vs few-shot 视角）。这击溃了 \"probe 在 cost-accuracy Pareto 前沿优于\n      LLM\" 的 claim。原因：LLM 能直接理解 trajectory 的语义内容（agent 在做什么、是否有进展），而 probe 只能\n      通过 embedding 的统计模式间接推断。CoT 进一步允许 LLM 逐步推理 \"这个窗口的 actions 是否朝目标推进\"。\n      probe 的唯一优势是成本（615× cheaper）和延迟（667× faster），这在 reframed paper 中降为 practical\n      advantage。注意：即使 worst tier，LLM 的绝对成本仍不便宜（$0.032/window × 54K windows ≈ $1750 全量），\n      因此成本故事仍可讲，但不是 main claim。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LLM-as-Judge Results on Gold Set\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Setting\", \"Gold Macro-F1\", \"Stag F1\", \"Prog F1\", \"Cost/window\", \"Latency\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Claude 3.5 Sonnet\", \"zero-shot\", \"0.780\", \"0.725\", \"0.835\", \"$0.028\", \"2.4s\"]\n          - [\"Claude 3.5 Sonnet\", \"few-shot (3)\", \"0.820\", \"0.772\", \"0.868\", \"$0.035\", \"2.9s\"]\n          - [\"Claude 3.5 Sonnet\", \"CoT\", \"0.855\", \"0.810\", \"0.900\", \"$0.042\", \"3.8s\"]\n          - [\"GPT-4o\", \"zero-shot\", \"0.765\", \"0.710\", \"0.820\", \"$0.025\", \"2.1s\"]\n          - [\"GPT-4o\", \"few-shot (3)\", \"0.808\", \"0.758\", \"0.858\", \"$0.032\", \"2.7s\"]\n          - [\"GPT-4o\", \"CoT\", \"0.840\", \"0.795\", \"0.885\", \"$0.038\", \"3.5s\"]\n          - [\"Probe (GRU)\", \"—\", \"0.720\", \"0.650\", \"0.790\", \"$0.000052\", \"4.2ms\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cost-accuracy Pareto 图：x 轴 log(cost/window)，y 轴 gold macro-F1，probe 位于左下（低成本低 F1），LLM CoT 位于右上（高成本高 F1），Pareto 前沿由 LLM 系列主导\"\n      - \"Bar chart: 按 stagnation 子类型（repetitive, semantic-diverse, partial-progress）分解各方法的 F1\"\n    analysis: >\n      LLM CoT 全面碾压 probe 是 worst tier 的预期结果。Probe 的 cost-accuracy Pareto 优势不成立——\n      但成本维度仍有故事：全量 54K windows 的 LLM 成本约 $1750（CoT），而 probe 仅 $2.8。对于持续\n      监控场景（数百万 windows），probe 仍是唯一可行方案。Reframed paper 将 LLM 结果定位为 upper bound，\n      probe 定位为 \"affordable approximation for continuous monitoring\"。\n\n  - name: \"baseline-meanpool-lr\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-meanpool-lr\"\n    description: \"Mean-pooling + logistic regression baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      conf2_meanpool_lr_macro_f1: 0.8435\n      conf2_meanpool_mlp_macro_f1: 0.8572\n      conf2_gru_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      conf2_gap_gru_vs_meanpool: 0.0483\n      conf1_meanpool_lr_macro_f1: 0.7591\n      conf1_meanpool_mlp_macro_f1: 0.7781\n      conf1_gru_macro_f1: 0.8468\n      conf1_gap_gru_vs_meanpool: 0.0687\n      gold_meanpool_lr_macro_f1: 0.688\n      gold_gru_macro_f1: 0.720\n      gold_gap: 0.032\n    result_rationale: >\n      GRU 在自动标签上持续优于 mean-pool（conf≥2 +4.8pp, conf≥1 +6.9pp），且在 gold set 上也保持\n      优势（+3.2pp）。但 gold set 上的 gap 缩小（从 auto 的 4.8-6.9pp 到 gold 的 3.2pp），说明\n      GRU 的部分时序建模优势来自对 LF 投票模式（而非真实 progress 信号）的建模。尽管如此，\n      GRU > mean-pool 在所有评估条件下一致成立，这是 worst tier 中的可靠发现——GRU 时序建模确实比\n      无序聚合更好，特别是在高噪声标签（conf≥1）上 gap 更大（+12.7pp on auto），说明时序结构帮助\n      模型在噪声中提取信号。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: GRU vs Mean-Pool across Evaluation Settings\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"Mean-Pool LR\", \"Mean-Pool MLP\", \"GRU Probe\", \"GRU Gain vs Best Pool\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Auto conf≥2\", \"0.8435\", \"0.8572\", \"0.9055\", \"+4.83pp\"]\n          - [\"Auto conf≥1\", \"0.7591\", \"0.7781\", \"0.8468\", \"+6.87pp\"]\n          - [\"Gold Set\", \"0.688\", \"0.701\", \"0.720\", \"+1.9pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: 三个评估场景下 mean-pool vs GRU 的 F1 对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      Gold set 上 GRU 优势缩小但仍存在。对于 reframed paper，\"GRU temporal modeling provides +12.7pp\n      over mean-pool on noisy labels (conf≥1)\" 是可靠的实证贡献——证明时序建模在弱监督的高噪声场景下\n      特别有价值。这个发现不依赖 temporal label model 是否成立。\n\n  - name: \"error-analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"error-analysis\"\n    description: \"Probe 错误分析：FP/FN 按 action type、LF source、trajectory outcome 分类\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_errors_gold: 112\n      false_positive_count: 48\n      false_negative_count: 64\n      fn_semantic_diverse_stagnation_pct: 0.58\n      fn_partial_progress_pct: 0.27\n      fn_other_pct: 0.15\n      fp_exploratory_actions_pct: 0.52\n      fp_conf1_region_pct: 0.73\n      fp_outcome_bp_dependent_pct: 0.35\n    result_rationale: >\n      FN（漏报 stagnation）占多数（64 vs 48 FP），其中 58% 是语义多样的停滞——agent 执行了看似不同\n      但实际无效的 actions。这正是 probe 最难捕获的模式，因为 embedding 层面这些 windows 与 progress\n      windows 相似（表面多样性高）。FP 中 52% 发生在 agent 执行探索性 actions（试错阶段）——这些\n      在语义上与停滞类似（重复尝试不同方法）但实际有进展。73% 的 FP 落在 conf=1 区域，说明 LF 分歧\n      区域是 probe 的主要薄弱点。35% 的 FP 与 outcome_bp 相关（如果移除 outcome_bp 会有更多错误），\n      侧面印证泄露依赖。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Error Breakdown by Category\"\n        columns: [\"Error Type\", \"Count\", \"% of Total Errors\", \"Dominant Pattern\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FN: Semantic-diverse stag.\", \"37\", \"33%\", \"Surface-diverse but goal-unrelated actions\"]\n          - [\"FN: Partial progress\", \"17\", \"15%\", \"Some progress mixed with stagnation\"]\n          - [\"FN: Other\", \"10\", \"9%\", \"Edge cases, annotation disagreement\"]\n          - [\"FP: Exploratory actions\", \"25\", \"22%\", \"Trial-and-error resembles stagnation\"]\n          - [\"FP: conf=1 region\", \"35\", \"31%\", \"LF disagreement → noisy training signal\"]\n          - [\"FP: outcome_bp dependent\", \"17\", \"15%\", \"Correct only because of outcome_bp leak\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar chart: FP/FN 按 stagnation 子类型分解\"\n      - \"Example windows: 2 个 FN case（semantic-diverse stagnation）和 2 个 FP case（exploratory），展示 probe 失败的具体模式\"\n    analysis: >\n      错误分析揭示 probe 的系统性弱点：对 semantic-diverse stagnation 的检测能力差（这类 case 需要\n      goal-level reasoning，超出 embedding 统计模式的能力）。这与 LLM CoT 在这些 case 上表现更好\n      一致——LLM 能直接推理 \"agent 是否在朝目标前进\"。对 reframed paper，错误分析成为 \"failure mode\n      characterization\" 的核心内容，揭示弱监督方法的边界。\n\n  - name: \"cross-agent\"\n    plan_id: \"cross-agent\"\n    description: \"OpenHands 轨迹上的 cross-implementation 迁移评估\"\n    expected_results:\n      openhands_total_trajectories: 2340\n      openhands_total_windows: 18720\n      openhands_lf_coverage: 0.82\n      openhands_lf_agreement_rate: 0.61\n      probe_cross_agent_macro_f1: 0.612\n      probe_same_agent_macro_f1: 0.906\n      cross_agent_degradation_pp: 29.4\n      lf_oracle_cross_agent_f1: 0.685\n      lf_oracle_same_agent_f1: 0.945\n      lf_oracle_cross_degradation_pp: 26.0\n      repeat3_cross_agent_f1: 0.590\n      probe_vs_lf_oracle_cross_gap: -7.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-agent probe F1 降至 0.612（从 0.906），退化 29.4pp——远超 LF oracle 的退化（26.0pp）。\n      A4 假设成立：probe 未能学到通用的 goal-directed progress 信号，其性能高度依赖于训练数据的 agent\n      实现（SWE-agent）。根本原因：(1) OpenHands 的 action 格式、命令模式与 SWE-agent 差异大，\n      embedding 空间分布偏移；(2) LFs 在 OpenHands 上的覆盖率仅 82%（vs SWE-agent ~95%），某些\n      LF 的触发模式不同（如 OpenHands 的 command_repetition 模式不同）；(3) LF oracle 在 cross-agent\n      上也大幅退化（0.685），但仍优于 probe（+7.3pp），说明 LF 启发式比 learned features 更鲁棒地\n      迁移——这直接否定了 \"probe learns transferable signals\" 的 claim。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Agent Transfer Results\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Same-Agent F1\", \"Cross-Agent F1\", \"Degradation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Probe (GRU)\", \"0.906\", \"0.612\", \"-29.4pp\"]\n          - [\"LF Oracle (MV)\", \"0.945\", \"0.685\", \"-26.0pp\"]\n          - [\"Repeat-3\", \"0.843\", \"0.590\", \"-25.3pp\"]\n          - [\"Mean-Pool LR\", \"0.843\", \"0.558\", \"-28.5pp\"]\n          - [\"CosineSim\", \"0.582\", \"0.480\", \"-10.2pp\"]\n      - name: \"Table: LF Coverage on OpenHands\"\n        columns: [\"LF\", \"SWE-agent Coverage\", \"OpenHands Coverage\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"command_repetition\", \"0.95\", \"0.88\", \"-7%\"]\n          - [\"output_similarity\", \"0.92\", \"0.85\", \"-7%\"]\n          - [\"outcome_backpropagation\", \"0.78\", \"0.62\", \"-16%\"]\n          - [\"edit_cycle_detection\", \"0.88\", \"0.79\", \"-9%\"]\n          - [\"Ensemble\", \"0.95\", \"0.82\", \"-13%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Degradation bar chart: 各方法 same-agent → cross-agent 的 F1 下降幅度对比\"\n      - \"t-SNE: SWE-agent vs OpenHands 的 embedding 空间分布，展示 domain shift\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-agent 迁移严重退化且 probe 退化比 LF oracle 更严重——这是 worst tier 的关键负面结果。\n      Claim 3 (cross-implementation transferability) 不成立。Reframed paper 中这变为 \"failure mode\n      analysis of transfer\"：系统性量化 domain shift 对弱监督 pipeline 各组件的影响，本身是对 WS\n      community 的有价值贡献。特别是 outcome_bp 在 OpenHands 上覆盖率大幅下降（-16%），呼应了\n      泄露分析的结论。\n\n  - name: \"temporal-label-model\"\n    plan_id: \"temporal-label-model\"\n    description: \"Temporal label model — 利用 LF 时序动态进行时序感知标签聚合\"\n    expected_results:\n      temporal_lm_gold_macro_f1: 0.770\n      majority_vote_gold_macro_f1: 0.745\n      temporal_lm_vs_mv_gain_pp: 2.5\n      flyingsquid_gold_macro_f1: 0.772\n      temporal_lm_vs_flyingsquid_gain_pp: -0.2\n      temporal_lm_auto_conf2_agreement: 0.94\n      temporal_lm_auto_conf1_agreement: 0.71\n      hmm_log_likelihood: -18420\n      hmm_num_states: 2\n      leading_lf_weight_cmd_rep: 1.35\n      lagging_lf_weight_outcome_bp: 0.72\n      temporal_lm_label_flip_rate: 0.083\n    result_rationale: >\n      A1+A2 成立。Temporal label model 对比 MV 仅提升 2.5pp（在 [1,4] 范围内）——统计上可能显著但\n      实质增益小。更致命的是对比 FlyingSquid 仅 -0.2pp（在 [-2,1] 范围内），说明 FlyingSquid 的\n      相关性建模已经捕获了 LF 间的主要依赖结构，temporal label model 的时序建模没有额外增益。\n      原因：虽然 LFs 确实存在时序动态（command_repetition 领先 ~1.8 steps, outcome_bp 滞后 ~2.1 steps），\n      但这种时序结构在 window 级别（k=5 steps）上被 averaging 效应稀释——在一个 5-step window 内，\n      leading 和 lagging 的差异不足以产生有意义的标签差异。HMM 确实学到了 leading/lagging 权重\n      （cmd_rep: 1.35, outcome_bp: 0.72），但这些权重调整只翻转了 8.3% 的标签（vs MV），且翻转的\n      标签在 gold set 上的正确率仅约 55%（接近随机）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Label Model Comparison on Gold Set\"\n        columns: [\"Label Model\", \"Gold Macro-F1\", \"Gold Accuracy\", \"Stag F1\", \"Prog F1\", \"Label Flip Rate vs MV\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Majority Vote\", \"0.745\", \"0.780\", \"0.680\", \"0.810\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"FlyingSquid\", \"0.772\", \"0.803\", \"0.712\", \"0.832\", \"0.112\"]\n          - [\"Temporal LM (HMM)\", \"0.770\", \"0.800\", \"0.708\", \"0.832\", \"0.083\"]\n          - [\"Temporal LM (weighted)\", \"0.762\", \"0.795\", \"0.698\", \"0.826\", \"0.065\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Learned Temporal Weights\"\n        columns: [\"LF\", \"Temporal Role\", \"Lag (steps)\", \"Learned Weight\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"command_repetition\", \"leading\", \"-1.8\", \"1.35\"]\n          - [\"output_similarity\", \"concurrent\", \"0.0\", \"1.12\"]\n          - [\"edit_cycle_detection\", \"concurrent\", \"-0.3\", \"1.08\"]\n          - [\"outcome_backpropagation\", \"lagging\", \"+2.1\", \"0.72\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 四种 label model 在 gold set 上的 F1 对比，error bars 显示 bootstrap CI\"\n      - \"Heatmap: HMM transition matrix 展示 temporal label model 学到的状态转移结构\"\n      - \"Line plot: 各 LF 在 stagnation onset 前后的触发概率曲线（temporal dynamics visualization）\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 worst tier 的决定性结果：temporal label model 无法超越 FlyingSquid，核心方法论贡献不成立。\n      论文无法以 \"temporal label model\" 为 main contribution 投稿。然而，temporal dynamics 的\n      characterization（leading/lagging 分析）本身是有价值的实证发现——它揭示了 data programming 在\n      sequential data 上的 i.i.d. 假设违反的具体形式和程度。Reframed paper 将此转化为 \"failure mode\n      analysis of standard DP on sequential agent data\"。\n\n  - name: \"flyingsquid-baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"flyingsquid-baseline\"\n    description: \"FlyingSquid 相关性感知 label model baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      flyingsquid_gold_macro_f1: 0.772\n      flyingsquid_auto_agreement_with_mv: 0.889\n      flyingsquid_label_flip_rate: 0.112\n      flyingsquid_flip_accuracy_on_gold: 0.63\n      flyingsquid_training_time_sec: 45\n      flyingsquid_vs_mv_gain_pp: 2.7\n      flyingsquid_vs_temporal_lm_gain_pp: 0.2\n      flyingsquid_estimated_lf_correlations:\n        cmd_rep_output_sim: 0.42\n        cmd_rep_edit_cycle: 0.38\n        output_sim_outcome_bp: 0.51\n        edit_cycle_outcome_bp: 0.35\n    result_rationale: >\n      FlyingSquid 通过建模 LF 间相关性达到 gold F1 0.772，比 MV 提升 2.7pp，与 temporal label model\n      持平（+0.2pp）。FlyingSquid 的核心优势是它无需显式建模时序结构，而是通过 triplet method 直接\n      估计 LF 间的统计依赖——而 LF 间的时序相关性（leading/lagging）恰好被这种统计依赖所捕获。\n      换言之，temporal structure 在 LF 输出上的表现就是 LF 间的相关性，FlyingSquid 已经在建模这个。\n      这解释了为什么 temporal label model 没有额外增益——时序信息是 LF 相关性的子集。FlyingSquid\n      翻转了 11.2% 的标签（vs MV），翻转准确率 63%（高于 temporal LM 的 55%），说明它更准确地\n      识别了 MV 的错误。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: FlyingSquid vs Majority Vote Details\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Majority Vote\", \"FlyingSquid\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Gold Macro-F1\", \"0.745\", \"0.772\", \"+2.7pp\"]\n          - [\"Gold Stagnation F1\", \"0.680\", \"0.712\", \"+3.2pp\"]\n          - [\"Gold Progress F1\", \"0.810\", \"0.832\", \"+2.2pp\"]\n          - [\"Label Flip Rate vs MV\", \"—\", \"11.2%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Flip Accuracy (gold)\", \"—\", \"63%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Training Time\", \"0s\", \"45s\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Venn diagram: MV vs FlyingSquid vs Temporal LM 标签翻转的重叠分析\"\n    analysis: >\n      FlyingSquid 匹配 temporal label model 的性能——直接说明 reviewer concern \"Why not use a label\n      model?\" 的答案是 \"确实可以用，且效果一样好\"。这彻底堵死了 temporal label model 作为方法论贡献的路。\n      Reframed paper 将 FlyingSquid 和 temporal LM 的 comparison 作为 \"what existing tools already\n      handle\" 的实证基础，然后聚焦于它们都无法解决的问题（如 conf=1 区域的标签质量）。\n\n  - name: \"outcome-bp-sensitivity\"\n    plan_id: \"outcome-bp-sensitivity\"\n    description: \"outcome_backpropagation 信息泄露分析\"\n    expected_results:\n      exit_context_trajectory_pct: 0.78\n      exit_context_window_pct: 0.31\n      holdout_outcome_bp_probe_f1: 0.832\n      original_probe_f1: 0.906\n      holdout_f1_drop_pp: 7.4\n      holdout_stagnation_f1: 0.762\n      original_stagnation_f1: 0.859\n      holdout_stag_drop_pp: 9.7\n      last_n_only_variant_f1_drop_pp: 4.2\n      last_3_windows_f1: 0.868\n      last_1_window_f1: 0.812\n      outcome_bp_marginal_contribution: 0.42\n    result_rationale: >\n      A5 成立。Hold-out outcome_bp 后 probe F1 从 0.906 降至 0.832（-7.4pp），在 [5,12] 范围内。\n      Stagnation class 受打击更大（-9.7pp），因为 outcome_bp 是 stagnation 检测的最强信号之一——\n      它直接利用了任务最终结果（resolved/unresolved）来反向标注窗口。exit_context 覆盖 78% 的轨迹\n      和 31% 的窗口（主要是最后几个窗口），这意味着近 1/3 的训练标签受 outcome_bp 直接影响。\n      信息泄露的本质是：outcome_bp 将\"任务是否成功\"的信息注入到过程中的窗口标签，使得 probe\n      可能学到了\"该轨迹最终失败\"的信号而非\"这个窗口是否有进展\"。Last-N variant 显示限制\n      outcome_bp 仅作用于最后 3 个窗口时 F1 仅降 4.2pp（vs 全部 hold-out 的 7.4pp），说明\n      中间窗口对 outcome_bp 的依赖更严重。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Outcome BP Sensitivity Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Variant\", \"Macro-F1\", \"Stag F1\", \"Prog F1\", \"Δ vs Original\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Original (all LFs)\", \"0.906\", \"0.859\", \"0.952\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Hold-out outcome_bp\", \"0.832\", \"0.762\", \"0.902\", \"-7.4pp\"]\n          - [\"outcome_bp last-3 only\", \"0.868\", \"0.815\", \"0.921\", \"-3.8pp\"]\n          - [\"outcome_bp last-1 only\", \"0.812\", \"0.738\", \"0.886\", \"-9.4pp\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Exit Context Coverage\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Trajectories with exit_context\", \"78%\"]\n          - [\"Windows affected by outcome_bp\", \"31%\"]\n          - [\"outcome_bp marginal contribution (LF hold-out)\", \"0.42\"]\n          - [\"outcome_bp alone accuracy (conf=1 cases)\", \"0.71\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Waterfall chart: 原始 F1 → hold-out 各 LF 后的 F1 下降，outcome_bp 贡献最大\"\n      - \"Heatmap: outcome_bp 影响的窗口在轨迹中的位置分布（主要集中在后半段）\"\n    analysis: >\n      7.4pp 的下降证实了 outcome_bp 泄露的实质性（A5 成立）。这不仅是 probe 的问题——任何使用\n      outcome_bp 标签训练的模型都面临同样的泄露。Reframed paper 将此作为 \"a cautionary tale for\n      weak supervision on agent trajectories\"：(1) 量化泄露的严重程度；(2) 提出缓解方案（last-N 限制）\n      及其 tradeoff；(3) 建议未来工作应分离过程信号和结果信号。这本身是对 WS community 的实证贡献。\n\n  - name: \"ablation-window-size\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-window-size\"\n    description: \"Window size 消融：k=3,5,7\"\n    expected_results:\n      k3_macro_f1: 0.878\n      k5_macro_f1: 0.906\n      k7_macro_f1: 0.895\n      k3_stag_f1: 0.812\n      k5_stag_f1: 0.859\n      k7_stag_f1: 0.848\n      k3_total_windows: 82214\n      k5_total_windows: 54809\n      k7_total_windows: 39149\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=5 仍是最优选择。k=3 降 2.8pp（窗口太短，信号积累不足以区分短暂停顿和持续停滞），k=7 降 1.1pp\n      （窗口太长，stagnation onset 信号被稀释，且训练数据量减少 28%）。这个结果在 worst tier 下不受\n      影响——window size 是 task formulation 的设计选择，不依赖于 temporal label model 或 cross-agent\n      的成败。但 gold set 上的差异可能更小（所有 k 都在 0.70-0.74 范围），降低了 window size 选择的\n      重要性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Window Size Ablation\"\n        columns: [\"k\", \"N_windows\", \"Auto Macro-F1\", \"Stag F1\", \"Prog F1\", \"Gold Macro-F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"3\", \"82214\", \"0.878\", \"0.812\", \"0.944\", \"0.705\"]\n          - [\"5\", \"54809\", \"0.906\", \"0.859\", \"0.952\", \"0.720\"]\n          - [\"7\", \"39149\", \"0.895\", \"0.848\", \"0.942\", \"0.718\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line chart: k vs F1 (auto and gold)，展示 k=5 的最优性和 gold set 上的平坦曲线\"\n    analysis: >\n      Window size 消融结果清晰但对 reframed paper 的故事贡献有限——在 gold set 上三个 k 值差异\n      很小（1.5pp range），说明 window size 不是 performance 的主要 bottleneck。这可以简短报告\n      在 appendix 中。\n\n  - name: \"ablation-architecture\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-architecture\"\n    description: \"架构消融：GRU+attention vs GRU+mean-pool vs Transformer encoder vs MLP\"\n    expected_results:\n      gru_attention_macro_f1: 0.912\n      gru_meanpool_macro_f1: 0.906\n      transformer_macro_f1: 0.903\n      mlp_pooled_macro_f1: 0.857\n      gru_attention_gold_f1: 0.728\n      gru_meanpool_gold_f1: 0.720\n      transformer_gold_f1: 0.722\n      mlp_pooled_gold_f1: 0.701\n      gru_attention_params: 285000\n      transformer_params: 1240000\n      mlp_pooled_params: 132000\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 auto labels 上架构差异不大：GRU+attention（0.912）> GRU+mean-pool（0.906）> Transformer（0.903）\n      > MLP（0.857）。在 gold set 上差异进一步缩小至 2.7pp range。这说明架构选择不是关键因素——\n      bottleneck 在于标签质量和 embedding 表征，而非序列建模能力。Transformer 在参数量 4x 的情况下\n      未能超越 GRU，印证了 \"此任务不需要复杂架构\" 的直觉。对 reframed paper，这支持将 architecture\n      降权为 \"engineering choice\" 的 framing。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Architecture Ablation\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Params\", \"Auto F1\", \"Gold F1\", \"Inference (ms)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU + Attention\", \"285K\", \"0.912\", \"0.728\", \"5.1\"]\n          - [\"GRU + Mean-pool\", \"198K\", \"0.906\", \"0.720\", \"4.2\"]\n          - [\"Transformer (2L)\", \"1.24M\", \"0.903\", \"0.722\", \"8.7\"]\n          - [\"MLP on pooled\", \"132K\", \"0.857\", \"0.701\", \"1.8\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: params vs gold F1，展示 diminishing returns\"\n    analysis: >\n      架构消融证实 GRU 是合理选择（最优 cost-performance tradeoff），但 gold set 上差异微小。\n      这强化了 \"标签质量是 bottleneck\" 的论点。\n\n  - name: \"ablation-lf-holdout\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-lf-holdout\"\n    description: \"LF hold-one-out 消融：移除一个 LF 重新训练，量化边际贡献\"\n    expected_results:\n      full_ensemble_f1: 0.906\n      holdout_command_repetition_f1: 0.875\n      holdout_output_similarity_f1: 0.882\n      holdout_edit_cycle_f1: 0.891\n      holdout_outcome_bp_f1: 0.832\n      marginal_cmd_rep: 0.031\n      marginal_output_sim: 0.024\n      marginal_edit_cycle: 0.015\n      marginal_outcome_bp: 0.074\n    result_rationale: >\n      outcome_bp 的边际贡献最大（-7.4pp），远超其他 LF（command_repetition -3.1pp, output_similarity\n      -2.4pp, edit_cycle -1.5pp）。这与 outcome-bp-sensitivity 结果一致，进一步强调了 outcome_bp\n      的主导地位和泄露风险。在 worst tier 下这个结果特别有害——它说明整个 LF ensemble 的性能\n      高度依赖一个有泄露嫌疑的 LF。去除 outcome_bp 后的 \"clean\" 性能（0.832）才是真实性能，\n      而这个水平在 gold set 上可能进一步下降到 0.68-0.70，接近 mean-pool baseline。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LF Hold-One-Out\"\n        columns: [\"Held-out LF\", \"Auto Macro-F1\", \"Δ vs Full\", \"Marginal Contribution\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"None (full)\", \"0.906\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"command_repetition\", \"0.875\", \"-3.1pp\", \"0.031\"]\n          - [\"output_similarity\", \"0.882\", \"-2.4pp\", \"0.024\"]\n          - [\"edit_cycle_detection\", \"0.891\", \"-1.5pp\", \"0.015\"]\n          - [\"outcome_backpropagation\", \"0.832\", \"-7.4pp\", \"0.074\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Waterfall chart: 各 LF hold-out 后的 F1 下降，outcome_bp 明显突出\"\n    analysis: >\n      outcome_bp 主导 LF ensemble——去除它后性能下降最多。这与泄露分析形成闭环：最强的 LF 也是\n      最有泄露嫌疑的 LF。Reframed paper 中这成为 \"leaky heuristics can dominate weak supervision\n      pipelines\" 的实证警示。\n\n  - name: \"ablation-supcon\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-supcon\"\n    description: \"SupCon 辅助损失消融\"\n    expected_results:\n      with_supcon_auto_f1: 0.912\n      without_supcon_auto_f1: 0.906\n      supcon_gain_pp: 0.6\n      with_supcon_gold_f1: 0.723\n      without_supcon_gold_f1: 0.720\n      supcon_gold_gain_pp: 0.3\n      embedding_separation_with: 0.82\n      embedding_separation_without: 0.74\n    result_rationale: >\n      SupCon 在 auto labels 上提升 0.6pp，gold set 上仅 0.3pp——增量微小，不构成关键设计选择。\n      Embedding 分离度确实提高（0.74→0.82），但这未转化为有意义的分类提升。在 worst tier 下\n      这是可预期的——当标签本身有噪声时，contrastive loss 可能推开的是噪声标签定义的类别边界，\n      而非真实的 progress/stagnation 边界。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: SupCon Ablation\"\n        columns: [\"Variant\", \"Auto F1\", \"Gold F1\", \"Embed Separation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU + SupCon\", \"0.912\", \"0.723\", \"0.82\"]\n          - [\"GRU (CE only)\", \"0.906\", \"0.720\", \"0.74\"]\n          - [\"Δ\", \"+0.6pp\", \"+0.3pp\", \"+0.08\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE: 有/无 SupCon 的 hidden state 分布对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      SupCon 增量可忽略。简报于 appendix 即可。\n\n  - name: \"non-nlp-baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"non-nlp-baseline\"\n    description: \"Non-NLP baseline：纯结构/数值特征分类\"\n    expected_results:\n      structural_features_f1: 0.752\n      structural_features_stag_f1: 0.695\n      structural_features_prog_f1: 0.808\n      nl_probe_f1: 0.906\n      nl_vs_structural_gap_pp: 15.4\n      structural_gold_f1: 0.680\n      nl_gold_f1: 0.720\n      nl_vs_structural_gold_gap_pp: 4.0\n      features_used: [\"lines_changed\", \"file_count\", \"test_count\", \"command_type_entropy\", \"ast_diff_size\", \"edit_frequency\"]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Structural baseline 在 auto labels 上达 0.752（比 probe 低 15.4pp），但在 gold set 上差距\n      缩小到仅 4.0pp（0.680 vs 0.720）。这说明 NL embedding 的优势部分来自对 LF 模式的拟合\n      而非真实 progress 信号。结构特征在 gold set 上仍明显弱于 NL（4pp gap），但这个 gap 不够大\n      以支撑强 claim。在 worst tier 下，structural baseline 的相对竞争力削弱了 \"NL understanding\n      is essential for stagnation detection\" 的论点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: NL vs Structural Features\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Auto F1\", \"Gold F1\", \"Features\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"NL Probe (GRU)\", \"0.906\", \"0.720\", \"Qwen3-Embedding 1024d\"]\n          - [\"Structural (GBT)\", \"0.752\", \"0.680\", \"6 numeric features\"]\n          - [\"Structural (LR)\", \"0.718\", \"0.665\", \"6 numeric features\"]\n          - [\"Δ NL vs best Structural\", \"+15.4pp\", \"+4.0pp\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Feature importance bar chart: structural baseline 中各特征的重要性排序\"\n    analysis: >\n      NL embedding 在 gold set 上仍优于 structural（+4pp），但 gap 不大。Reframed paper 中这\n      可以实事求是地报告——NL embedding 有增量但 structural features 提供了合理的 lower bound。\n\n  - name: \"encoder-ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"encoder-ablation\"\n    description: \"Embedding encoder 消融：Qwen3 vs BGE-M3 vs E5-large vs GTE\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen3_auto_f1: 0.906\n      bge_m3_auto_f1: 0.898\n      e5_large_auto_f1: 0.892\n      gte_auto_f1: 0.885\n      qwen3_gold_f1: 0.720\n      bge_m3_gold_f1: 0.715\n      e5_large_gold_f1: 0.708\n      gte_gold_f1: 0.702\n      qwen3_dim: 1024\n      bge_m3_dim: 1024\n      e5_large_dim: 1024\n      gte_dim: 768\n    result_rationale: >\n      四个 encoder 在 auto labels 上差异 2.1pp（0.885-0.906），gold set 上差异仅 1.8pp（0.702-0.720）。\n      Qwen3 最优但优势不大——说明 encoder 选择不是性能瓶颈。在 worst tier 下这意味着即使换更强的\n      encoder 也不会拯救 probe 的 gold set 性能。瓶颈在于标签质量和任务本身的难度，而非 embedding\n      质量。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Encoder Ablation\"\n        columns: [\"Encoder\", \"Dim\", \"Auto F1\", \"Gold F1\", \"Embed Time (min)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B\", \"1024\", \"0.906\", \"0.720\", \"53\"]\n          - [\"BGE-M3\", \"1024\", \"0.898\", \"0.715\", \"48\"]\n          - [\"E5-large-v2\", \"1024\", \"0.892\", \"0.708\", \"45\"]\n          - [\"GTE-base\", \"768\", \"0.885\", \"0.702\", \"32\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 四个 encoder 在 auto 和 gold 上的 F1 并排对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      Encoder 选择影响小于 2pp。Qwen3 合理但非关键。简报于 appendix。\n\n  - name: \"data-scaling\"\n    plan_id: \"data-scaling\"\n    description: \"Data scaling 曲线：10%/25%/50%/100% 训练数据 → probe F1\"\n    expected_results:\n      pct10_auto_f1: 0.862\n      pct25_auto_f1: 0.882\n      pct50_auto_f1: 0.898\n      pct100_auto_f1: 0.906\n      pct10_gold_f1: 0.695\n      pct25_gold_f1: 0.708\n      pct50_gold_f1: 0.715\n      pct100_gold_f1: 0.720\n      saturation_point: \"~50%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Auto labels 上从 10% 到 100% 提升 4.4pp，大部分增益在 50% 时已饱和。Gold set 上更明显——\n      10% 到 100% 仅提升 2.5pp，且 50% 后接近完全饱和。这说明更多弱监督数据的边际收益极小，\n      性能瓶颈不在数据量而在标签质量。在 worst tier 下这进一步支持了\"标签质量是 bottleneck\"的论点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Data Scaling\"\n        columns: [\"Train %\", \"N_train\", \"Auto F1\", \"Gold F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"10%\", \"~1080\", \"0.862\", \"0.695\"]\n          - [\"25%\", \"~2700\", \"0.882\", \"0.708\"]\n          - [\"50%\", \"~5400\", \"0.898\", \"0.715\"]\n          - [\"100%\", \"~10780\", \"0.906\", \"0.720\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Learning curve: x=training data %, y=F1 (auto + gold)，标注 saturation elbow\"\n    analysis: >\n      早期饱和。50% 数据即可达到 98% 的最终性能。这对 reframed paper 的实证贡献是有帮助的——\n      说明弱监督 pipeline 的瓶颈不在数据量。\n\n  - name: \"early-termination-sim\"\n    plan_id: \"early-termination-sim\"\n    description: \"Simulated early termination：tokens saved vs success rate tradeoff\"\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_success_rate: 0.285\n      probe_threshold_08_success_rate: 0.268\n      probe_threshold_08_tokens_saved_pct: 18.5\n      probe_threshold_06_success_rate: 0.242\n      probe_threshold_06_tokens_saved_pct: 32.1\n      probe_threshold_04_success_rate: 0.198\n      probe_threshold_04_tokens_saved_pct: 48.7\n      oracle_threshold_success_rate: 0.280\n      oracle_tokens_saved_pct: 35.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      Early termination 展示了 precision-cost tradeoff。在保守阈值（0.8）下，仅节省 18.5% tokens\n      但 success rate 几乎不变（-1.7pp）。激进阈值（0.4）节省 48.7% 但 success rate 降 8.7pp。\n      问题在于 probe 在 gold set 上的 F1 仅 0.72，导致 false positive（误判为 stagnation 而\n      提前终止本可成功的轨迹）率较高。Oracle（完美检测器）能节省 35.2% tokens 且几乎不损失\n      success rate，说明 stagnation detection 的理论价值存在，但当前 probe 精度不够。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Early Termination Simulation\"\n        columns: [\"Threshold\", \"Success Rate\", \"Tokens Saved %\", \"False Termination %\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Baseline (no term.)\", \"28.5%\", \"0%\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"Probe t=0.8\", \"26.8%\", \"18.5%\", \"6.2%\"]\n          - [\"Probe t=0.6\", \"24.2%\", \"32.1%\", \"14.8%\"]\n          - [\"Probe t=0.4\", \"19.8%\", \"48.7%\", \"28.5%\"]\n          - [\"Oracle\", \"28.0%\", \"35.2%\", \"0.5%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pareto curve: tokens saved % vs success rate，probe 各阈值点 + oracle 标注\"\n    analysis: >\n      Probe 精度不足以支撑激进的 early termination。但保守阈值（t=0.8）提供了 \"免费午餐\"\n      （18.5% savings, 1.7pp cost）。Reframed paper 可以简短讨论 downstream application。\n\n  - name: \"interpretability\"\n    plan_id: \"interpretability\"\n    description: \"t-SNE/UMAP visualization + attention weight analysis\"\n    expected_results:\n      tsne_silhouette_score: 0.31\n      umap_silhouette_score: 0.28\n      attention_entropy_stagnation: 1.82\n      attention_entropy_progress: 2.15\n      attention_peak_at_onset: false\n      dominant_attention_step: \"middle of window\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      t-SNE 显示 progress 和 stagnation 的 hidden states 有一定分离（silhouette 0.31），但重叠\n      显著——大量边界 case 混杂在交界区域。这与 gold set 上的 moderate F1（0.72）一致。Attention\n      分析未发现明确的 \"stagnation onset detection\" 模式——attention 权重分布相对均匀，略偏向\n      窗口中间步骤，而非集中在 onset 点。这说明 GRU 没有学到 reviewer 可能期待的 \"temporal\n      attention to key transition points\"，而是在做更粗粒度的 pattern matching。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE 2D scatter: progress (blue) vs stagnation (red) 的 GRU hidden states，标注 silhouette score\"\n      - \"Attention heatmap: 5 个典型 progress 和 5 个 stagnation windows 的 attention weights 对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      Interpretability 结果 moderate——有可视化但不惊艳。适合 appendix figure。\n\n  - name: \"human-annotation\"\n    plan_id: \"human-annotation\"\n    description: \"400 窗口人工标注 gold set（3 annotators, Fleiss κ）\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_annotated_windows: 420\n      annotators: 3\n      fleiss_kappa: 0.52\n      pairwise_kappa_12: 0.55\n      pairwise_kappa_13: 0.48\n      pairwise_kappa_23: 0.54\n      agreement_rate: 0.68\n      unanimous_agreement_pct: 0.45\n      gold_label_distribution_stag_pct: 0.38\n      gold_label_distribution_prog_pct: 0.62\n      mv_auto_vs_gold_agreement: 0.73\n      annotation_time_per_window_min: 4.2\n      total_annotation_hours: 29.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      A6 成立。Fleiss κ=0.52（[0.45, 0.60] 范围内），属于 \"moderate agreement\"——stagnation\n      边界本质上模糊。三名标注者仅在 45% 的 case 上完全一致，说明 \"progress vs stagnation\" 不是\n      二元清晰的判断。标注者在 \"partial progress\"（有些进展但不够多）case 上分歧最大。Auto MV\n      标签与 gold 仅 73% 一致——27% 的不一致中，约 60% 是 auto 标签标错，40% 是标注者间也有分歧。\n      κ<0.60 意味着 reviewer 会质疑 task definition 本身的清晰度，以及 gold set 作为 ground truth\n      的可靠性。对 reframed paper，这反而成为正面发现——\"stagnation detection is inherently ambiguous\"\n      是对 task formulation 的重要实证洞见。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Human Annotation Statistics\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Total windows annotated\", \"420\"]\n          - [\"Annotators\", \"3\"]\n          - [\"Fleiss κ\", \"0.52\"]\n          - [\"Unanimous agreement\", \"45%\"]\n          - [\"Majority agreement\", \"68%\"]\n          - [\"Auto MV vs Gold agreement\", \"73%\"]\n          - [\"Annotation time/window\", \"4.2 min\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Disagreement Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Disagreement Type\", \"Count\", \"% of Disagreements\", \"Example Pattern\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Partial progress\", \"58\", \"43%\", \"Some file edits but no test improvement\"]\n          - [\"Exploration vs stagnation\", \"35\", \"26%\", \"Trying different approaches\"]\n          - [\"Outcome-influenced\", \"22\", \"16%\", \"Annotator knowledge of final outcome\"]\n          - [\"Annotation error\", \"20\", \"15%\", \"Missed context / fatigue\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Confusion matrix: auto MV labels vs gold labels\"\n      - \"Bar chart: κ per stagnation sub-type，展示哪些子类型标注一致性最差\"\n    analysis: >\n      κ=0.52 是 worst tier 的重要结果——它说明 stagnation 概念本身在边界处模糊，任何方法的 gold set\n      F1 都有天花板。这解释了为什么 probe、LF oracle、甚至 LLM judge 在 gold set 上都有较大误差。\n      Reframed paper 将此作为 \"task inherent ambiguity\" 的核心发现。\n\n  - name: \"lf-temporal-dynamics\"\n    plan_id: \"lf-temporal-dynamics\"\n    description: \"LF temporal dynamics：哪个 LF 在 stagnation onset 最先亮灯\"\n    expected_results:\n      command_repetition_lead_steps: 1.8\n      output_similarity_lead_steps: 0.5\n      edit_cycle_lead_steps: 0.2\n      outcome_bp_lag_steps: 2.1\n      cmd_rep_is_leading: true\n      outcome_bp_is_lagging: true\n      temporal_correlation_cmd_rep_outcome_bp: 0.38\n      temporal_autocorrelation_lag1_cmd_rep: 0.72\n      temporal_autocorrelation_lag1_outcome_bp: 0.85\n      lf_transition_consistency: 0.61\n    result_rationale: >\n      LF temporal dynamics 分析确认了预期的 leading/lagging 结构：command_repetition 在 stagnation\n      onset 前 ~1.8 steps 就开始触发（leading indicator），而 outcome_bp 在 onset 后 ~2.1 steps\n      才触发（lagging indicator，因为需要看到最终结果才能回传）。这个分析本身是有价值的——但问题在于\n      这个时序结构未能被 temporal label model 有效利用（vs FlyingSquid 无显著差异）。原因分析：\n      LF 的时序自相关很高（cmd_rep lag-1: 0.72, outcome_bp lag-1: 0.85），意味着在 window 级别\n      它们的值变化缓慢，leading/lagging 的差异在 5-step 窗口内被 smoothing 掉。LF 间的 transition\n      consistency 仅 0.61——不够强以支撑可靠的时序标签调整。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LF Temporal Roles\"\n        columns: [\"LF\", \"Lead/Lag (steps)\", \"Role\", \"Autocorrelation (lag-1)\", \"Onset Detection Rate\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"command_repetition\", \"-1.8\", \"Leading\", \"0.72\", \"0.68\"]\n          - [\"output_similarity\", \"-0.5\", \"Concurrent\", \"0.65\", \"0.61\"]\n          - [\"edit_cycle_detection\", \"-0.2\", \"Concurrent\", \"0.58\", \"0.55\"]\n          - [\"outcome_backpropagation\", \"+2.1\", \"Lagging\", \"0.85\", \"0.78\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: 各 LF 在 stagnation onset 前后 [-5, +5] 步窗口内的触发概率曲线\"\n      - \"Cross-correlation heatmap: LF 对之间的时间滞后相关性\"\n    analysis: >\n      Temporal dynamics 分析是 reframed paper 的核心实证贡献之一——即使 temporal label model 未能\n      利用它，这个 characterization 本身对 WS community 有价值。它揭示了 data programming 在\n      sequential data 上的 i.i.d. 假设违反的具体形式：LFs 不是 independent——它们有系统性的时序\n      依赖（leading/lagging），这意味着标准 DP 的条件独立假设在 agent trajectory 上系统性失效。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12805,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12805},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2a2c3b6b-be0a-4a84-a4c0-944524ebc718","uuid":"bbd73edf-1570-4267-ab1f-b10731dba8bd"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":408915,"duration_api_ms":410211,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  核心假设（temporal label model 作为方法论贡献）不成立。Temporal label model 对比 FlyingSquid 无显著优势（-2~+1pp），\n  说明 LF 相关性建模已足够，时序动态不能转化为标签质量增益。outcome_bp 泄露严重（hold-out 后 F1 下降 7-10pp），动摇标签可靠性。\n  Probe 在 gold set 上低于 LF oracle 或仅持平，student-exceeds-teacher 不成立。LLM-as-judge CoT 在 gold set 上\n  明确优于 probe（gap 5-8pp），probe 仅剩成本优势。Cross-agent 迁移退化严重（F1<0.65）。人工标注 κ<0.60 表明 stagnation\n  边界本身模糊。论文需从 method contribution 彻底 reframe 为 empirical study：(1) 系统性揭示 data programming\n  在 agent trajectory 上的 failure modes（i.i.d. 违反、LF 时序动态 characterization、outcome_bp 泄露量化）；\n  (2) stagnation taxonomy + window-level formulation 作为 task contribution；(3) GRU 时序建模在高噪声标签上的鲁棒性\n  作为实证发现。目标 Findings of EMNLP，预期 reviewer score 3.0-3.5。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"probe-multiseed\"\n    plan_id: \"probe-multiseed\"\n    description: \"多 seed 验证（seed=42,123,456）确认 gap 统计稳定性\"\n    expected_results:\n      mean_macro_f1_auto: 0.9025\n      std_macro_f1_auto: 0.0185\n      seed_42_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      seed_123_macro_f1: 0.8870\n      seed_456_macro_f1: 0.9150\n      all_seeds_above_070: true\n      all_seeds_gap_above_5pp_vs_repeat3: true\n      mean_macro_f1_gold: 0.72\n      std_macro_f1_gold: 0.031\n    result_rationale: >\n      在自动标签（conf≥2）上多 seed 表现稳定（std~0.019），gap vs Repeat-3 始终 >5pp——这不是问题所在。\n      问题在于一旦切换到 gold set 评估，三个 seed 均降至 0.69-0.75 区间（mean 0.72），暴露出 probe 在\n      conf≥2 上的高 F1 部分来自对 LF 噪声模式的 overfitting。Gold set 上 std 增大到 0.031，说明\n      模型在真实标签分布上不如在自动标签上稳定。这本身是一个有价值的实证发现——high auto-F1 不等价于 high gold-F1，\n      但作为方法贡献的支撑不够。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Multi-seed Stability (Auto Labels vs Gold Set)\"\n        columns: [\"Seed\", \"Auto Macro-F1\", \"Gold Macro-F1\", \"Gap vs Repeat-3 (auto)\", \"Gap vs LF Oracle (gold)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"42\", \"0.9055\", \"0.7380\", \"+6.2pp\", \"-0.8pp\"]\n          - [\"123\", \"0.8870\", \"0.6920\", \"+4.4pp\", \"-2.5pp\"]\n          - [\"456\", \"0.9150\", \"0.7250\", \"+7.2pp\", \"-1.2pp\"]\n          - [\"Mean±Std\", \"0.903±0.019\", \"0.718±0.031\", \"+5.9±1.4pp\", \"-1.5±0.9pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Box plot: 三个 seed 在 auto labels 和 gold set 上的 macro-F1 分布对比，清晰展示 auto→gold 的性能下降\"\n    analysis: >\n      多 seed 在 auto labels 上稳定（符合预期），但 gold set 上均值仅 0.72 且 variance 增大。\n      最关键的发现是 gold set 上 probe vs LF oracle 差距为 -1.5pp（mean），student-exceeds-teacher\n      claim 不成立。这意味着 probe 未能学到超越 LF 启发式的信号，只是以 neural 方式逼近了 LF 的判断。\n      对于 reframed paper，这转化为\"probe 在 noisy labels 上的鲁棒性\"实证发现——即使 gold-F1 不高，\n      它在 LF 不可用的推理场景下仍提供 0.72 的可用估计。\n\n  - name: \"cosinesim-check\"\n    plan_id: \"cosinesim-check\"\n    description: \"CosineSim baseline 排查：threshold 值、分数分布、确认 0.3129 是否合理\"\n    expected_results:\n      original_f1: 0.3129\n      issue_found: \"threshold miscalibration\"\n      optimal_threshold: 0.78\n      corrected_f1: 0.5820\n      distribution_overlap_ratio: 0.68\n    result_rationale: >\n      原始 0.3129 确实存在 threshold 问题——默认 threshold=0.5 在 embedding 空间中不合理，因为连续 step\n      的 cosine similarity 普遍较高（mean~0.85）。优化 threshold 后 F1 升至 0.58，但仍远低于 probe（0.90）\n      和 Repeat-3（0.84）。根本原因是 cosine similarity 衡量的是相邻 step 的表面语义相似度，而 stagnation\n      涉及 window 级别的 goal-directed progress，单步 cosine 无法捕获这个层次。分布分析显示 progress 和\n      stagnation 窗口的 mean cosine 分布重叠率 68%，说明这个特征本身区分度有限。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: CosineSim Threshold Sweep\"\n        columns: [\"Threshold\", \"Precision\", \"Recall\", \"Macro-F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0.50 (default)\", \"0.218\", \"0.875\", \"0.313\"]\n          - [\"0.70\", \"0.412\", \"0.723\", \"0.498\"]\n          - [\"0.78 (optimal)\", \"0.561\", \"0.608\", \"0.582\"]\n          - [\"0.85\", \"0.645\", \"0.391\", \"0.472\"]\n          - [\"0.90\", \"0.712\", \"0.198\", \"0.295\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Histogram: progress vs stagnation 窗口的 mean pairwise cosine similarity 分布，展示高度重叠\"\n      - \"Line chart: threshold vs F1 曲线，标注 optimal threshold 位置\"\n    analysis: >\n      修正后 CosineSim（0.58）仍是最弱 baseline，确认 semantic similarity ≠ progress。但修正本身\n      重要——论文中需报告 corrected 版本（0.58），否则 reviewer 会质疑 baseline 是否被刻意弱化。\n      在 reframed paper 中，这成为\"stagnation 不等于 repetition\"的实证证据。\n\n  - name: \"probe-002\"\n    plan_id: \"probe-002\"\n    description: \"全量数据训练（conf≥1, 54,809 windows）vs conf≥2 对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      conf1_auto_macro_f1: 0.8468\n      conf2_auto_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      delta_auto: -0.0587\n      conf1_gold_macro_f1: 0.735\n      conf2_gold_macro_f1: 0.720\n      delta_gold: +0.015\n      conf1_train_windows: 38161\n      conf2_train_windows: 10780\n      conf1_stagnation_f1: 0.7772\n      conf1_progress_f1: 0.9165\n    result_rationale: >\n      在自动标签上 conf≥1 比 conf≥2 低 5.9pp——符合预期，因为 conf=1 的标签噪声高（72% 的数据是\n      conf=1，LF 分歧严重）。但在 gold set 上反转：conf≥1 训练的 probe（0.735）略高于 conf≥2（0.720），\n      因为更大的训练数据量补偿了噪声。这是 worst tier 中少有的正面发现：GRU 对标签噪声具有鲁棒性。\n      结合 baseline-meanpool-lr 的结果（mean-pool 在 conf≥1 上降至 0.778，GRU 仍有 0.847），\n      GRU 时序建模在高噪声下的增量价值（+12.7pp vs mean-pool）成为可讲的实证贡献。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Label Noise Tolerance (conf≥1 vs conf≥2)\"\n        columns: [\"Training Set\", \"N_train\", \"Auto Macro-F1\", \"Gold Macro-F1\", \"Stag F1 (auto)\", \"Prog F1 (auto)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"conf≥2\", \"10780\", \"0.9055\", \"0.720\", \"0.859\", \"0.952\"]\n          - [\"conf≥1 (full)\", \"38161\", \"0.8468\", \"0.735\", \"0.777\", \"0.917\"]\n          - [\"Δ\", \"+27381\", \"-5.9pp\", \"+1.5pp\", \"-8.2pp\", \"-3.5pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: conf≥1 vs conf≥2 在 auto labels 和 gold set 上的 F1 对比，突出 auto→gold 反转\"\n    analysis: >\n      Auto-label 上 conf≥2 更优（数据干净），但 gold set 上 conf≥1 略好（数据量大）——这个反转\n      本身是有价值的发现。对于 reframed paper，这构成 \"probe robustness to label noise\" 的核心证据，\n      说明在弱监督场景下 GRU 的时序建模能从高噪声数据中提取有用信号。\n\n  - name: \"baseline-lf-oracle\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-lf-oracle\"\n    description: \"LF ensemble oracle baseline — 直接用 LF 实时输出做窗口级判定\"\n    expected_results:\n      lf_oracle_auto_conf2_macro_f1: 0.9450\n      lf_oracle_auto_conf1_macro_f1: 0.8200\n      lf_oracle_gold_macro_f1: 0.7450\n      probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.7200\n      probe_vs_lf_oracle_gold_gap_pp: -2.5\n      lf_oracle_coverage: 1.0\n      lf_oracle_conf1_accuracy: 0.62\n    result_rationale: >\n      LF oracle 在 conf≥2 auto labels 上 F1=0.945（接近天花板，因为 auto labels 本身就是 LF 投票生成的）。\n      在 gold set 上 LF oracle 达到 0.745，而 probe 仅 0.72——probe 未能超越 LF oracle（gap -2.5pp）。\n      这直接否定了 \"student exceeds teacher\" 的 claim。根本原因：在 worst tier 下，gold set 的标签\n      分布与 LF 投票结果高度一致（因为 human annotators 在模糊 case 上也倾向于与 LF 多数一致），\n      probe 没有额外信号来源，其泛化优势无法体现。LF oracle 在 conf=1 上仅 0.62 accuracy（随机猜测\n      级别），但 probe 在这些 case 上也未显著更好，说明 conf=1 的困难 case 对两者都是硬骨头。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Probe vs LF Oracle\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Auto conf≥2 F1\", \"Auto conf≥1 F1\", \"Gold F1\", \"Inference Time\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LF Oracle (MV)\", \"0.945\", \"0.820\", \"0.745\", \"~0ms (rule-based)\"]\n          - [\"LF Oracle (any-2)\", \"0.938\", \"0.795\", \"0.738\", \"~0ms\"]\n          - [\"Probe (GRU)\", \"0.906\", \"0.847\", \"0.720\", \"4.2ms\"]\n          - [\"Δ Probe vs MV Oracle\", \"-3.9pp\", \"+2.7pp\", \"-2.5pp\", \"+4.2ms\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Confusion matrix pair: LF oracle vs Probe 在 gold set 上的错误模式对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      Probe 未能超越 LF oracle 是 worst tier 的核心打击。然而，probe 在 conf≥1（LF 分歧严重区域）上\n      auto-F1 比 LF oracle 高 2.7pp——说明 probe 在 LF 不确定时确实提供了增量信号，只是这个增量不足以\n      在 gold set 上体现。Reframed paper 中将这个结果诚实报告为 \"probe approximates but does not exceed\n      LF oracle\"，转而强调 probe 在 LF 不可用场景（跨 agent、新 agent）的价值。\n\n  - name: \"baseline-llm-judge\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-llm-judge\"\n    description: \"LLM-as-judge baseline（Claude/GPT-4o, zero-shot + few-shot + CoT）\"\n    expected_results:\n      claude_zero_shot_gold_f1: 0.780\n      claude_few_shot_gold_f1: 0.820\n      claude_cot_gold_f1: 0.855\n      gpt4o_zero_shot_gold_f1: 0.765\n      gpt4o_few_shot_gold_f1: 0.808\n      gpt4o_cot_gold_f1: 0.840\n      probe_gold_f1: 0.720\n      probe_vs_best_llm_gap_pp: -13.5\n      probe_vs_llm_cot_gap_pp: -5.5\n      llm_cost_per_window_usd: 0.032\n      probe_cost_per_window_usd: 0.000052\n      cost_ratio: 615\n      llm_latency_ms: 2800\n      probe_latency_ms: 4.2\n      latency_ratio: 667\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLM-as-judge（特别是 CoT variant）在 gold set 上明确优于 probe。Claude CoT 达到 0.855（vs probe 0.72，\n      gap -13.5pp vs zero-shot, -5.5pp vs few-shot 视角）。这击溃了 \"probe 在 cost-accuracy Pareto 前沿优于\n      LLM\" 的 claim。原因：LLM 能直接理解 trajectory 的语义内容（agent 在做什么、是否有进展），而 probe 只能\n      通过 embedding 的统计模式间接推断。CoT 进一步允许 LLM 逐步推理 \"这个窗口的 actions 是否朝目标推进\"。\n      probe 的唯一优势是成本（615× cheaper）和延迟（667× faster），这在 reframed paper 中降为 practical\n      advantage。注意：即使 worst tier，LLM 的绝对成本仍不便宜（$0.032/window × 54K windows ≈ $1750 全量），\n      因此成本故事仍可讲，但不是 main claim。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LLM-as-Judge Results on Gold Set\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Setting\", \"Gold Macro-F1\", \"Stag F1\", \"Prog F1\", \"Cost/window\", \"Latency\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Claude 3.5 Sonnet\", \"zero-shot\", \"0.780\", \"0.725\", \"0.835\", \"$0.028\", \"2.4s\"]\n          - [\"Claude 3.5 Sonnet\", \"few-shot (3)\", \"0.820\", \"0.772\", \"0.868\", \"$0.035\", \"2.9s\"]\n          - [\"Claude 3.5 Sonnet\", \"CoT\", \"0.855\", \"0.810\", \"0.900\", \"$0.042\", \"3.8s\"]\n          - [\"GPT-4o\", \"zero-shot\", \"0.765\", \"0.710\", \"0.820\", \"$0.025\", \"2.1s\"]\n          - [\"GPT-4o\", \"few-shot (3)\", \"0.808\", \"0.758\", \"0.858\", \"$0.032\", \"2.7s\"]\n          - [\"GPT-4o\", \"CoT\", \"0.840\", \"0.795\", \"0.885\", \"$0.038\", \"3.5s\"]\n          - [\"Probe (GRU)\", \"—\", \"0.720\", \"0.650\", \"0.790\", \"$0.000052\", \"4.2ms\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cost-accuracy Pareto 图：x 轴 log(cost/window)，y 轴 gold macro-F1，probe 位于左下（低成本低 F1），LLM CoT 位于右上（高成本高 F1），Pareto 前沿由 LLM 系列主导\"\n      - \"Bar chart: 按 stagnation 子类型（repetitive, semantic-diverse, partial-progress）分解各方法的 F1\"\n    analysis: >\n      LLM CoT 全面碾压 probe 是 worst tier 的预期结果。Probe 的 cost-accuracy Pareto 优势不成立——\n      但成本维度仍有故事：全量 54K windows 的 LLM 成本约 $1750（CoT），而 probe 仅 $2.8。对于持续\n      监控场景（数百万 windows），probe 仍是唯一可行方案。Reframed paper 将 LLM 结果定位为 upper bound，\n      probe 定位为 \"affordable approximation for continuous monitoring\"。\n\n  - name: \"baseline-meanpool-lr\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-meanpool-lr\"\n    description: \"Mean-pooling + logistic regression baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      conf2_meanpool_lr_macro_f1: 0.8435\n      conf2_meanpool_mlp_macro_f1: 0.8572\n      conf2_gru_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      conf2_gap_gru_vs_meanpool: 0.0483\n      conf1_meanpool_lr_macro_f1: 0.7591\n      conf1_meanpool_mlp_macro_f1: 0.7781\n      conf1_gru_macro_f1: 0.8468\n      conf1_gap_gru_vs_meanpool: 0.0687\n      gold_meanpool_lr_macro_f1: 0.688\n      gold_gru_macro_f1: 0.720\n      gold_gap: 0.032\n    result_rationale: >\n      GRU 在自动标签上持续优于 mean-pool（conf≥2 +4.8pp, conf≥1 +6.9pp），且在 gold set 上也保持\n      优势（+3.2pp）。但 gold set 上的 gap 缩小（从 auto 的 4.8-6.9pp 到 gold 的 3.2pp），说明\n      GRU 的部分时序建模优势来自对 LF 投票模式（而非真实 progress 信号）的建模。尽管如此，\n      GRU > mean-pool 在所有评估条件下一致成立，这是 worst tier 中的可靠发现——GRU 时序建模确实比\n      无序聚合更好，特别是在高噪声标签（conf≥1）上 gap 更大（+12.7pp on auto），说明时序结构帮助\n      模型在噪声中提取信号。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: GRU vs Mean-Pool across Evaluation Settings\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"Mean-Pool LR\", \"Mean-Pool MLP\", \"GRU Probe\", \"GRU Gain vs Best Pool\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Auto conf≥2\", \"0.8435\", \"0.8572\", \"0.9055\", \"+4.83pp\"]\n          - [\"Auto conf≥1\", \"0.7591\", \"0.7781\", \"0.8468\", \"+6.87pp\"]\n          - [\"Gold Set\", \"0.688\", \"0.701\", \"0.720\", \"+1.9pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: 三个评估场景下 mean-pool vs GRU 的 F1 对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      Gold set 上 GRU 优势缩小但仍存在。对于 reframed paper，\"GRU temporal modeling provides +12.7pp\n      over mean-pool on noisy labels (conf≥1)\" 是可靠的实证贡献——证明时序建模在弱监督的高噪声场景下\n      特别有价值。这个发现不依赖 temporal label model 是否成立。\n\n  - name: \"error-analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"error-analysis\"\n    description: \"Probe 错误分析：FP/FN 按 action type、LF source、trajectory outcome 分类\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_errors_gold: 112\n      false_positive_count: 48\n      false_negative_count: 64\n      fn_semantic_diverse_stagnation_pct: 0.58\n      fn_partial_progress_pct: 0.27\n      fn_other_pct: 0.15\n      fp_exploratory_actions_pct: 0.52\n      fp_conf1_region_pct: 0.73\n      fp_outcome_bp_dependent_pct: 0.35\n    result_rationale: >\n      FN（漏报 stagnation）占多数（64 vs 48 FP），其中 58% 是语义多样的停滞——agent 执行了看似不同\n      但实际无效的 actions。这正是 probe 最难捕获的模式，因为 embedding 层面这些 windows 与 progress\n      windows 相似（表面多样性高）。FP 中 52% 发生在 agent 执行探索性 actions（试错阶段）——这些\n      在语义上与停滞类似（重复尝试不同方法）但实际有进展。73% 的 FP 落在 conf=1 区域，说明 LF 分歧\n      区域是 probe 的主要薄弱点。35% 的 FP 与 outcome_bp 相关（如果移除 outcome_bp 会有更多错误），\n      侧面印证泄露依赖。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Error Breakdown by Category\"\n        columns: [\"Error Type\", \"Count\", \"% of Total Errors\", \"Dominant Pattern\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FN: Semantic-diverse stag.\", \"37\", \"33%\", \"Surface-diverse but goal-unrelated actions\"]\n          - [\"FN: Partial progress\", \"17\", \"15%\", \"Some progress mixed with stagnation\"]\n          - [\"FN: Other\", \"10\", \"9%\", \"Edge cases, annotation disagreement\"]\n          - [\"FP: Exploratory actions\", \"25\", \"22%\", \"Trial-and-error resembles stagnation\"]\n          - [\"FP: conf=1 region\", \"35\", \"31%\", \"LF disagreement → noisy training signal\"]\n          - [\"FP: outcome_bp dependent\", \"17\", \"15%\", \"Correct only because of outcome_bp leak\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar chart: FP/FN 按 stagnation 子类型分解\"\n      - \"Example windows: 2 个 FN case（semantic-diverse stagnation）和 2 个 FP case（exploratory），展示 probe 失败的具体模式\"\n    analysis: >\n      错误分析揭示 probe 的系统性弱点：对 semantic-diverse stagnation 的检测能力差（这类 case 需要\n      goal-level reasoning，超出 embedding 统计模式的能力）。这与 LLM CoT 在这些 case 上表现更好\n      一致——LLM 能直接推理 \"agent 是否在朝目标前进\"。对 reframed paper，错误分析成为 \"failure mode\n      characterization\" 的核心内容，揭示弱监督方法的边界。\n\n  - name: \"cross-agent\"\n    plan_id: \"cross-agent\"\n    description: \"OpenHands 轨迹上的 cross-implementation 迁移评估\"\n    expected_results:\n      openhands_total_trajectories: 2340\n      openhands_total_windows: 18720\n      openhands_lf_coverage: 0.82\n      openhands_lf_agreement_rate: 0.61\n      probe_cross_agent_macro_f1: 0.612\n      probe_same_agent_macro_f1: 0.906\n      cross_agent_degradation_pp: 29.4\n      lf_oracle_cross_agent_f1: 0.685\n      lf_oracle_same_agent_f1: 0.945\n      lf_oracle_cross_degradation_pp: 26.0\n      repeat3_cross_agent_f1: 0.590\n      probe_vs_lf_oracle_cross_gap: -7.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-agent probe F1 降至 0.612（从 0.906），退化 29.4pp——远超 LF oracle 的退化（26.0pp）。\n      A4 假设成立：probe 未能学到通用的 goal-directed progress 信号，其性能高度依赖于训练数据的 agent\n      实现（SWE-agent）。根本原因：(1) OpenHands 的 action 格式、命令模式与 SWE-agent 差异大，\n      embedding 空间分布偏移；(2) LFs 在 OpenHands 上的覆盖率仅 82%（vs SWE-agent ~95%），某些\n      LF 的触发模式不同（如 OpenHands 的 command_repetition 模式不同）；(3) LF oracle 在 cross-agent\n      上也大幅退化（0.685），但仍优于 probe（+7.3pp），说明 LF 启发式比 learned features 更鲁棒地\n      迁移——这直接否定了 \"probe learns transferable signals\" 的 claim。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Agent Transfer Results\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Same-Agent F1\", \"Cross-Agent F1\", \"Degradation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Probe (GRU)\", \"0.906\", \"0.612\", \"-29.4pp\"]\n          - [\"LF Oracle (MV)\", \"0.945\", \"0.685\", \"-26.0pp\"]\n          - [\"Repeat-3\", \"0.843\", \"0.590\", \"-25.3pp\"]\n          - [\"Mean-Pool LR\", \"0.843\", \"0.558\", \"-28.5pp\"]\n          - [\"CosineSim\", \"0.582\", \"0.480\", \"-10.2pp\"]\n      - name: \"Table: LF Coverage on OpenHands\"\n        columns: [\"LF\", \"SWE-agent Coverage\", \"OpenHands Coverage\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"command_repetition\", \"0.95\", \"0.88\", \"-7%\"]\n          - [\"output_similarity\", \"0.92\", \"0.85\", \"-7%\"]\n          - [\"outcome_backpropagation\", \"0.78\", \"0.62\", \"-16%\"]\n          - [\"edit_cycle_detection\", \"0.88\", \"0.79\", \"-9%\"]\n          - [\"Ensemble\", \"0.95\", \"0.82\", \"-13%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Degradation bar chart: 各方法 same-agent → cross-agent 的 F1 下降幅度对比\"\n      - \"t-SNE: SWE-agent vs OpenHands 的 embedding 空间分布，展示 domain shift\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-agent 迁移严重退化且 probe 退化比 LF oracle 更严重——这是 worst tier 的关键负面结果。\n      Claim 3 (cross-implementation transferability) 不成立。Reframed paper 中这变为 \"failure mode\n      analysis of transfer\"：系统性量化 domain shift 对弱监督 pipeline 各组件的影响，本身是对 WS\n      community 的有价值贡献。特别是 outcome_bp 在 OpenHands 上覆盖率大幅下降（-16%），呼应了\n      泄露分析的结论。\n\n  - name: \"temporal-label-model\"\n    plan_id: \"temporal-label-model\"\n    description: \"Temporal label model — 利用 LF 时序动态进行时序感知标签聚合\"\n    expected_results:\n      temporal_lm_gold_macro_f1: 0.770\n      majority_vote_gold_macro_f1: 0.745\n      temporal_lm_vs_mv_gain_pp: 2.5\n      flyingsquid_gold_macro_f1: 0.772\n      temporal_lm_vs_flyingsquid_gain_pp: -0.2\n      temporal_lm_auto_conf2_agreement: 0.94\n      temporal_lm_auto_conf1_agreement: 0.71\n      hmm_log_likelihood: -18420\n      hmm_num_states: 2\n      leading_lf_weight_cmd_rep: 1.35\n      lagging_lf_weight_outcome_bp: 0.72\n      temporal_lm_label_flip_rate: 0.083\n    result_rationale: >\n      A1+A2 成立。Temporal label model 对比 MV 仅提升 2.5pp（在 [1,4] 范围内）——统计上可能显著但\n      实质增益小。更致命的是对比 FlyingSquid 仅 -0.2pp（在 [-2,1] 范围内），说明 FlyingSquid 的\n      相关性建模已经捕获了 LF 间的主要依赖结构，temporal label model 的时序建模没有额外增益。\n      原因：虽然 LFs 确实存在时序动态（command_repetition 领先 ~1.8 steps, outcome_bp 滞后 ~2.1 steps），\n      但这种时序结构在 window 级别（k=5 steps）上被 averaging 效应稀释——在一个 5-step window 内，\n      leading 和 lagging 的差异不足以产生有意义的标签差异。HMM 确实学到了 leading/lagging 权重\n      （cmd_rep: 1.35, outcome_bp: 0.72），但这些权重调整只翻转了 8.3% 的标签（vs MV），且翻转的\n      标签在 gold set 上的正确率仅约 55%（接近随机）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Label Model Comparison on Gold Set\"\n        columns: [\"Label Model\", \"Gold Macro-F1\", \"Gold Accuracy\", \"Stag F1\", \"Prog F1\", \"Label Flip Rate vs MV\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Majority Vote\", \"0.745\", \"0.780\", \"0.680\", \"0.810\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"FlyingSquid\", \"0.772\", \"0.803\", \"0.712\", \"0.832\", \"0.112\"]\n          - [\"Temporal LM (HMM)\", \"0.770\", \"0.800\", \"0.708\", \"0.832\", \"0.083\"]\n          - [\"Temporal LM (weighted)\", \"0.762\", \"0.795\", \"0.698\", \"0.826\", \"0.065\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Learned Temporal Weights\"\n        columns: [\"LF\", \"Temporal Role\", \"Lag (steps)\", \"Learned Weight\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"command_repetition\", \"leading\", \"-1.8\", \"1.35\"]\n          - [\"output_similarity\", \"concurrent\", \"0.0\", \"1.12\"]\n          - [\"edit_cycle_detection\", \"concurrent\", \"-0.3\", \"1.08\"]\n          - [\"outcome_backpropagation\", \"lagging\", \"+2.1\", \"0.72\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 四种 label model 在 gold set 上的 F1 对比，error bars 显示 bootstrap CI\"\n      - \"Heatmap: HMM transition matrix 展示 temporal label model 学到的状态转移结构\"\n      - \"Line plot: 各 LF 在 stagnation onset 前后的触发概率曲线（temporal dynamics visualization）\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 worst tier 的决定性结果：temporal label model 无法超越 FlyingSquid，核心方法论贡献不成立。\n      论文无法以 \"temporal label model\" 为 main contribution 投稿。然而，temporal dynamics 的\n      characterization（leading/lagging 分析）本身是有价值的实证发现——它揭示了 data programming 在\n      sequential data 上的 i.i.d. 假设违反的具体形式和程度。Reframed paper 将此转化为 \"failure mode\n      analysis of standard DP on sequential agent data\"。\n\n  - name: \"flyingsquid-baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"flyingsquid-baseline\"\n    description: \"FlyingSquid 相关性感知 label model baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      flyingsquid_gold_macro_f1: 0.772\n      flyingsquid_auto_agreement_with_mv: 0.889\n      flyingsquid_label_flip_rate: 0.112\n      flyingsquid_flip_accuracy_on_gold: 0.63\n      flyingsquid_training_time_sec: 45\n      flyingsquid_vs_mv_gain_pp: 2.7\n      flyingsquid_vs_temporal_lm_gain_pp: 0.2\n      flyingsquid_estimated_lf_correlations:\n        cmd_rep_output_sim: 0.42\n        cmd_rep_edit_cycle: 0.38\n        output_sim_outcome_bp: 0.51\n        edit_cycle_outcome_bp: 0.35\n    result_rationale: >\n      FlyingSquid 通过建模 LF 间相关性达到 gold F1 0.772，比 MV 提升 2.7pp，与 temporal label model\n      持平（+0.2pp）。FlyingSquid 的核心优势是它无需显式建模时序结构，而是通过 triplet method 直接\n      估计 LF 间的统计依赖——而 LF 间的时序相关性（leading/lagging）恰好被这种统计依赖所捕获。\n      换言之，temporal structure 在 LF 输出上的表现就是 LF 间的相关性，FlyingSquid 已经在建模这个。\n      这解释了为什么 temporal label model 没有额外增益——时序信息是 LF 相关性的子集。FlyingSquid\n      翻转了 11.2% 的标签（vs MV），翻转准确率 63%（高于 temporal LM 的 55%），说明它更准确地\n      识别了 MV 的错误。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: FlyingSquid vs Majority Vote Details\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Majority Vote\", \"FlyingSquid\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Gold Macro-F1\", \"0.745\", \"0.772\", \"+2.7pp\"]\n          - [\"Gold Stagnation F1\", \"0.680\", \"0.712\", \"+3.2pp\"]\n          - [\"Gold Progress F1\", \"0.810\", \"0.832\", \"+2.2pp\"]\n          - [\"Label Flip Rate vs MV\", \"—\", \"11.2%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Flip Accuracy (gold)\", \"—\", \"63%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Training Time\", \"0s\", \"45s\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Venn diagram: MV vs FlyingSquid vs Temporal LM 标签翻转的重叠分析\"\n    analysis: >\n      FlyingSquid 匹配 temporal label model 的性能——直接说明 reviewer concern \"Why not use a label\n      model?\" 的答案是 \"确实可以用，且效果一样好\"。这彻底堵死了 temporal label model 作为方法论贡献的路。\n      Reframed paper 将 FlyingSquid 和 temporal LM 的 comparison 作为 \"what existing tools already\n      handle\" 的实证基础，然后聚焦于它们都无法解决的问题（如 conf=1 区域的标签质量）。\n\n  - name: \"outcome-bp-sensitivity\"\n    plan_id: \"outcome-bp-sensitivity\"\n    description: \"outcome_backpropagation 信息泄露分析\"\n    expected_results:\n      exit_context_trajectory_pct: 0.78\n      exit_context_window_pct: 0.31\n      holdout_outcome_bp_probe_f1: 0.832\n      original_probe_f1: 0.906\n      holdout_f1_drop_pp: 7.4\n      holdout_stagnation_f1: 0.762\n      original_stagnation_f1: 0.859\n      holdout_stag_drop_pp: 9.7\n      last_n_only_variant_f1_drop_pp: 4.2\n      last_3_windows_f1: 0.868\n      last_1_window_f1: 0.812\n      outcome_bp_marginal_contribution: 0.42\n    result_rationale: >\n      A5 成立。Hold-out outcome_bp 后 probe F1 从 0.906 降至 0.832（-7.4pp），在 [5,12] 范围内。\n      Stagnation class 受打击更大（-9.7pp），因为 outcome_bp 是 stagnation 检测的最强信号之一——\n      它直接利用了任务最终结果（resolved/unresolved）来反向标注窗口。exit_context 覆盖 78% 的轨迹\n      和 31% 的窗口（主要是最后几个窗口），这意味着近 1/3 的训练标签受 outcome_bp 直接影响。\n      信息泄露的本质是：outcome_bp 将\"任务是否成功\"的信息注入到过程中的窗口标签，使得 probe\n      可能学到了\"该轨迹最终失败\"的信号而非\"这个窗口是否有进展\"。Last-N variant 显示限制\n      outcome_bp 仅作用于最后 3 个窗口时 F1 仅降 4.2pp（vs 全部 hold-out 的 7.4pp），说明\n      中间窗口对 outcome_bp 的依赖更严重。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Outcome BP Sensitivity Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Variant\", \"Macro-F1\", \"Stag F1\", \"Prog F1\", \"Δ vs Original\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Original (all LFs)\", \"0.906\", \"0.859\", \"0.952\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Hold-out outcome_bp\", \"0.832\", \"0.762\", \"0.902\", \"-7.4pp\"]\n          - [\"outcome_bp last-3 only\", \"0.868\", \"0.815\", \"0.921\", \"-3.8pp\"]\n          - [\"outcome_bp last-1 only\", \"0.812\", \"0.738\", \"0.886\", \"-9.4pp\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Exit Context Coverage\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Trajectories with exit_context\", \"78%\"]\n          - [\"Windows affected by outcome_bp\", \"31%\"]\n          - [\"outcome_bp marginal contribution (LF hold-out)\", \"0.42\"]\n          - [\"outcome_bp alone accuracy (conf=1 cases)\", \"0.71\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Waterfall chart: 原始 F1 → hold-out 各 LF 后的 F1 下降，outcome_bp 贡献最大\"\n      - \"Heatmap: outcome_bp 影响的窗口在轨迹中的位置分布（主要集中在后半段）\"\n    analysis: >\n      7.4pp 的下降证实了 outcome_bp 泄露的实质性（A5 成立）。这不仅是 probe 的问题——任何使用\n      outcome_bp 标签训练的模型都面临同样的泄露。Reframed paper 将此作为 \"a cautionary tale for\n      weak supervision on agent trajectories\"：(1) 量化泄露的严重程度；(2) 提出缓解方案（last-N 限制）\n      及其 tradeoff；(3) 建议未来工作应分离过程信号和结果信号。这本身是对 WS community 的实证贡献。\n\n  - name: \"ablation-window-size\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-window-size\"\n    description: \"Window size 消融：k=3,5,7\"\n    expected_results:\n      k3_macro_f1: 0.878\n      k5_macro_f1: 0.906\n      k7_macro_f1: 0.895\n      k3_stag_f1: 0.812\n      k5_stag_f1: 0.859\n      k7_stag_f1: 0.848\n      k3_total_windows: 82214\n      k5_total_windows: 54809\n      k7_total_windows: 39149\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=5 仍是最优选择。k=3 降 2.8pp（窗口太短，信号积累不足以区分短暂停顿和持续停滞），k=7 降 1.1pp\n      （窗口太长，stagnation onset 信号被稀释，且训练数据量减少 28%）。这个结果在 worst tier 下不受\n      影响——window size 是 task formulation 的设计选择，不依赖于 temporal label model 或 cross-agent\n      的成败。但 gold set 上的差异可能更小（所有 k 都在 0.70-0.74 范围），降低了 window size 选择的\n      重要性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Window Size Ablation\"\n        columns: [\"k\", \"N_windows\", \"Auto Macro-F1\", \"Stag F1\", \"Prog F1\", \"Gold Macro-F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"3\", \"82214\", \"0.878\", \"0.812\", \"0.944\", \"0.705\"]\n          - [\"5\", \"54809\", \"0.906\", \"0.859\", \"0.952\", \"0.720\"]\n          - [\"7\", \"39149\", \"0.895\", \"0.848\", \"0.942\", \"0.718\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line chart: k vs F1 (auto and gold)，展示 k=5 的最优性和 gold set 上的平坦曲线\"\n    analysis: >\n      Window size 消融结果清晰但对 reframed paper 的故事贡献有限——在 gold set 上三个 k 值差异\n      很小（1.5pp range），说明 window size 不是 performance 的主要 bottleneck。这可以简短报告\n      在 appendix 中。\n\n  - name: \"ablation-architecture\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-architecture\"\n    description: \"架构消融：GRU+attention vs GRU+mean-pool vs Transformer encoder vs MLP\"\n    expected_results:\n      gru_attention_macro_f1: 0.912\n      gru_meanpool_macro_f1: 0.906\n      transformer_macro_f1: 0.903\n      mlp_pooled_macro_f1: 0.857\n      gru_attention_gold_f1: 0.728\n      gru_meanpool_gold_f1: 0.720\n      transformer_gold_f1: 0.722\n      mlp_pooled_gold_f1: 0.701\n      gru_attention_params: 285000\n      transformer_params: 1240000\n      mlp_pooled_params: 132000\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 auto labels 上架构差异不大：GRU+attention（0.912）> GRU+mean-pool（0.906）> Transformer（0.903）\n      > MLP（0.857）。在 gold set 上差异进一步缩小至 2.7pp range。这说明架构选择不是关键因素——\n      bottleneck 在于标签质量和 embedding 表征，而非序列建模能力。Transformer 在参数量 4x 的情况下\n      未能超越 GRU，印证了 \"此任务不需要复杂架构\" 的直觉。对 reframed paper，这支持将 architecture\n      降权为 \"engineering choice\" 的 framing。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Architecture Ablation\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Params\", \"Auto F1\", \"Gold F1\", \"Inference (ms)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU + Attention\", \"285K\", \"0.912\", \"0.728\", \"5.1\"]\n          - [\"GRU + Mean-pool\", \"198K\", \"0.906\", \"0.720\", \"4.2\"]\n          - [\"Transformer (2L)\", \"1.24M\", \"0.903\", \"0.722\", \"8.7\"]\n          - [\"MLP on pooled\", \"132K\", \"0.857\", \"0.701\", \"1.8\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: params vs gold F1，展示 diminishing returns\"\n    analysis: >\n      架构消融证实 GRU 是合理选择（最优 cost-performance tradeoff），但 gold set 上差异微小。\n      这强化了 \"标签质量是 bottleneck\" 的论点。\n\n  - name: \"ablation-lf-holdout\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-lf-holdout\"\n    description: \"LF hold-one-out 消融：移除一个 LF 重新训练，量化边际贡献\"\n    expected_results:\n      full_ensemble_f1: 0.906\n      holdout_command_repetition_f1: 0.875\n      holdout_output_similarity_f1: 0.882\n      holdout_edit_cycle_f1: 0.891\n      holdout_outcome_bp_f1: 0.832\n      marginal_cmd_rep: 0.031\n      marginal_output_sim: 0.024\n      marginal_edit_cycle: 0.015\n      marginal_outcome_bp: 0.074\n    result_rationale: >\n      outcome_bp 的边际贡献最大（-7.4pp），远超其他 LF（command_repetition -3.1pp, output_similarity\n      -2.4pp, edit_cycle -1.5pp）。这与 outcome-bp-sensitivity 结果一致，进一步强调了 outcome_bp\n      的主导地位和泄露风险。在 worst tier 下这个结果特别有害——它说明整个 LF ensemble 的性能\n      高度依赖一个有泄露嫌疑的 LF。去除 outcome_bp 后的 \"clean\" 性能（0.832）才是真实性能，\n      而这个水平在 gold set 上可能进一步下降到 0.68-0.70，接近 mean-pool baseline。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LF Hold-One-Out\"\n        columns: [\"Held-out LF\", \"Auto Macro-F1\", \"Δ vs Full\", \"Marginal Contribution\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"None (full)\", \"0.906\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"command_repetition\", \"0.875\", \"-3.1pp\", \"0.031\"]\n          - [\"output_similarity\", \"0.882\", \"-2.4pp\", \"0.024\"]\n          - [\"edit_cycle_detection\", \"0.891\", \"-1.5pp\", \"0.015\"]\n          - [\"outcome_backpropagation\", \"0.832\", \"-7.4pp\", \"0.074\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Waterfall chart: 各 LF hold-out 后的 F1 下降，outcome_bp 明显突出\"\n    analysis: >\n      outcome_bp 主导 LF ensemble——去除它后性能下降最多。这与泄露分析形成闭环：最强的 LF 也是\n      最有泄露嫌疑的 LF。Reframed paper 中这成为 \"leaky heuristics can dominate weak supervision\n      pipelines\" 的实证警示。\n\n  - name: \"ablation-supcon\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-supcon\"\n    description: \"SupCon 辅助损失消融\"\n    expected_results:\n      with_supcon_auto_f1: 0.912\n      without_supcon_auto_f1: 0.906\n      supcon_gain_pp: 0.6\n      with_supcon_gold_f1: 0.723\n      without_supcon_gold_f1: 0.720\n      supcon_gold_gain_pp: 0.3\n      embedding_separation_with: 0.82\n      embedding_separation_without: 0.74\n    result_rationale: >\n      SupCon 在 auto labels 上提升 0.6pp，gold set 上仅 0.3pp——增量微小，不构成关键设计选择。\n      Embedding 分离度确实提高（0.74→0.82），但这未转化为有意义的分类提升。在 worst tier 下\n      这是可预期的——当标签本身有噪声时，contrastive loss 可能推开的是噪声标签定义的类别边界，\n      而非真实的 progress/stagnation 边界。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: SupCon Ablation\"\n        columns: [\"Variant\", \"Auto F1\", \"Gold F1\", \"Embed Separation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU + SupCon\", \"0.912\", \"0.723\", \"0.82\"]\n          - [\"GRU (CE only)\", \"0.906\", \"0.720\", \"0.74\"]\n          - [\"Δ\", \"+0.6pp\", \"+0.3pp\", \"+0.08\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE: 有/无 SupCon 的 hidden state 分布对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      SupCon 增量可忽略。简报于 appendix 即可。\n\n  - name: \"non-nlp-baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"non-nlp-baseline\"\n    description: \"Non-NLP baseline：纯结构/数值特征分类\"\n    expected_results:\n      structural_features_f1: 0.752\n      structural_features_stag_f1: 0.695\n      structural_features_prog_f1: 0.808\n      nl_probe_f1: 0.906\n      nl_vs_structural_gap_pp: 15.4\n      structural_gold_f1: 0.680\n      nl_gold_f1: 0.720\n      nl_vs_structural_gold_gap_pp: 4.0\n      features_used: [\"lines_changed\", \"file_count\", \"test_count\", \"command_type_entropy\", \"ast_diff_size\", \"edit_frequency\"]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Structural baseline 在 auto labels 上达 0.752（比 probe 低 15.4pp），但在 gold set 上差距\n      缩小到仅 4.0pp（0.680 vs 0.720）。这说明 NL embedding 的优势部分来自对 LF 模式的拟合\n      而非真实 progress 信号。结构特征在 gold set 上仍明显弱于 NL（4pp gap），但这个 gap 不够大\n      以支撑强 claim。在 worst tier 下，structural baseline 的相对竞争力削弱了 \"NL understanding\n      is essential for stagnation detection\" 的论点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: NL vs Structural Features\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Auto F1\", \"Gold F1\", \"Features\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"NL Probe (GRU)\", \"0.906\", \"0.720\", \"Qwen3-Embedding 1024d\"]\n          - [\"Structural (GBT)\", \"0.752\", \"0.680\", \"6 numeric features\"]\n          - [\"Structural (LR)\", \"0.718\", \"0.665\", \"6 numeric features\"]\n          - [\"Δ NL vs best Structural\", \"+15.4pp\", \"+4.0pp\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Feature importance bar chart: structural baseline 中各特征的重要性排序\"\n    analysis: >\n      NL embedding 在 gold set 上仍优于 structural（+4pp），但 gap 不大。Reframed paper 中这\n      可以实事求是地报告——NL embedding 有增量但 structural features 提供了合理的 lower bound。\n\n  - name: \"encoder-ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"encoder-ablation\"\n    description: \"Embedding encoder 消融：Qwen3 vs BGE-M3 vs E5-large vs GTE\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen3_auto_f1: 0.906\n      bge_m3_auto_f1: 0.898\n      e5_large_auto_f1: 0.892\n      gte_auto_f1: 0.885\n      qwen3_gold_f1: 0.720\n      bge_m3_gold_f1: 0.715\n      e5_large_gold_f1: 0.708\n      gte_gold_f1: 0.702\n      qwen3_dim: 1024\n      bge_m3_dim: 1024\n      e5_large_dim: 1024\n      gte_dim: 768\n    result_rationale: >\n      四个 encoder 在 auto labels 上差异 2.1pp（0.885-0.906），gold set 上差异仅 1.8pp（0.702-0.720）。\n      Qwen3 最优但优势不大——说明 encoder 选择不是性能瓶颈。在 worst tier 下这意味着即使换更强的\n      encoder 也不会拯救 probe 的 gold set 性能。瓶颈在于标签质量和任务本身的难度，而非 embedding\n      质量。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Encoder Ablation\"\n        columns: [\"Encoder\", \"Dim\", \"Auto F1\", \"Gold F1\", \"Embed Time (min)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B\", \"1024\", \"0.906\", \"0.720\", \"53\"]\n          - [\"BGE-M3\", \"1024\", \"0.898\", \"0.715\", \"48\"]\n          - [\"E5-large-v2\", \"1024\", \"0.892\", \"0.708\", \"45\"]\n          - [\"GTE-base\", \"768\", \"0.885\", \"0.702\", \"32\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 四个 encoder 在 auto 和 gold 上的 F1 并排对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      Encoder 选择影响小于 2pp。Qwen3 合理但非关键。简报于 appendix。\n\n  - name: \"data-scaling\"\n    plan_id: \"data-scaling\"\n    description: \"Data scaling 曲线：10%/25%/50%/100% 训练数据 → probe F1\"\n    expected_results:\n      pct10_auto_f1: 0.862\n      pct25_auto_f1: 0.882\n      pct50_auto_f1: 0.898\n      pct100_auto_f1: 0.906\n      pct10_gold_f1: 0.695\n      pct25_gold_f1: 0.708\n      pct50_gold_f1: 0.715\n      pct100_gold_f1: 0.720\n      saturation_point: \"~50%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Auto labels 上从 10% 到 100% 提升 4.4pp，大部分增益在 50% 时已饱和。Gold set 上更明显——\n      10% 到 100% 仅提升 2.5pp，且 50% 后接近完全饱和。这说明更多弱监督数据的边际收益极小，\n      性能瓶颈不在数据量而在标签质量。在 worst tier 下这进一步支持了\"标签质量是 bottleneck\"的论点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Data Scaling\"\n        columns: [\"Train %\", \"N_train\", \"Auto F1\", \"Gold F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"10%\", \"~1080\", \"0.862\", \"0.695\"]\n          - [\"25%\", \"~2700\", \"0.882\", \"0.708\"]\n          - [\"50%\", \"~5400\", \"0.898\", \"0.715\"]\n          - [\"100%\", \"~10780\", \"0.906\", \"0.720\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Learning curve: x=training data %, y=F1 (auto + gold)，标注 saturation elbow\"\n    analysis: >\n      早期饱和。50% 数据即可达到 98% 的最终性能。这对 reframed paper 的实证贡献是有帮助的——\n      说明弱监督 pipeline 的瓶颈不在数据量。\n\n  - name: \"early-termination-sim\"\n    plan_id: \"early-termination-sim\"\n    description: \"Simulated early termination：tokens saved vs success rate tradeoff\"\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_success_rate: 0.285\n      probe_threshold_08_success_rate: 0.268\n      probe_threshold_08_tokens_saved_pct: 18.5\n      probe_threshold_06_success_rate: 0.242\n      probe_threshold_06_tokens_saved_pct: 32.1\n      probe_threshold_04_success_rate: 0.198\n      probe_threshold_04_tokens_saved_pct: 48.7\n      oracle_threshold_success_rate: 0.280\n      oracle_tokens_saved_pct: 35.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      Early termination 展示了 precision-cost tradeoff。在保守阈值（0.8）下，仅节省 18.5% tokens\n      但 success rate 几乎不变（-1.7pp）。激进阈值（0.4）节省 48.7% 但 success rate 降 8.7pp。\n      问题在于 probe 在 gold set 上的 F1 仅 0.72，导致 false positive（误判为 stagnation 而\n      提前终止本可成功的轨迹）率较高。Oracle（完美检测器）能节省 35.2% tokens 且几乎不损失\n      success rate，说明 stagnation detection 的理论价值存在，但当前 probe 精度不够。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Early Termination Simulation\"\n        columns: [\"Threshold\", \"Success Rate\", \"Tokens Saved %\", \"False Termination %\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Baseline (no term.)\", \"28.5%\", \"0%\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"Probe t=0.8\", \"26.8%\", \"18.5%\", \"6.2%\"]\n          - [\"Probe t=0.6\", \"24.2%\", \"32.1%\", \"14.8%\"]\n          - [\"Probe t=0.4\", \"19.8%\", \"48.7%\", \"28.5%\"]\n          - [\"Oracle\", \"28.0%\", \"35.2%\", \"0.5%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pareto curve: tokens saved % vs success rate，probe 各阈值点 + oracle 标注\"\n    analysis: >\n      Probe 精度不足以支撑激进的 early termination。但保守阈值（t=0.8）提供了 \"免费午餐\"\n      （18.5% savings, 1.7pp cost）。Reframed paper 可以简短讨论 downstream application。\n\n  - name: \"interpretability\"\n    plan_id: \"interpretability\"\n    description: \"t-SNE/UMAP visualization + attention weight analysis\"\n    expected_results:\n      tsne_silhouette_score: 0.31\n      umap_silhouette_score: 0.28\n      attention_entropy_stagnation: 1.82\n      attention_entropy_progress: 2.15\n      attention_peak_at_onset: false\n      dominant_attention_step: \"middle of window\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      t-SNE 显示 progress 和 stagnation 的 hidden states 有一定分离（silhouette 0.31），但重叠\n      显著——大量边界 case 混杂在交界区域。这与 gold set 上的 moderate F1（0.72）一致。Attention\n      分析未发现明确的 \"stagnation onset detection\" 模式——attention 权重分布相对均匀，略偏向\n      窗口中间步骤，而非集中在 onset 点。这说明 GRU 没有学到 reviewer 可能期待的 \"temporal\n      attention to key transition points\"，而是在做更粗粒度的 pattern matching。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE 2D scatter: progress (blue) vs stagnation (red) 的 GRU hidden states，标注 silhouette score\"\n      - \"Attention heatmap: 5 个典型 progress 和 5 个 stagnation windows 的 attention weights 对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      Interpretability 结果 moderate——有可视化但不惊艳。适合 appendix figure。\n\n  - name: \"human-annotation\"\n    plan_id: \"human-annotation\"\n    description: \"400 窗口人工标注 gold set（3 annotators, Fleiss κ）\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_annotated_windows: 420\n      annotators: 3\n      fleiss_kappa: 0.52\n      pairwise_kappa_12: 0.55\n      pairwise_kappa_13: 0.48\n      pairwise_kappa_23: 0.54\n      agreement_rate: 0.68\n      unanimous_agreement_pct: 0.45\n      gold_label_distribution_stag_pct: 0.38\n      gold_label_distribution_prog_pct: 0.62\n      mv_auto_vs_gold_agreement: 0.73\n      annotation_time_per_window_min: 4.2\n      total_annotation_hours: 29.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      A6 成立。Fleiss κ=0.52（[0.45, 0.60] 范围内），属于 \"moderate agreement\"——stagnation\n      边界本质上模糊。三名标注者仅在 45% 的 case 上完全一致，说明 \"progress vs stagnation\" 不是\n      二元清晰的判断。标注者在 \"partial progress\"（有些进展但不够多）case 上分歧最大。Auto MV\n      标签与 gold 仅 73% 一致——27% 的不一致中，约 60% 是 auto 标签标错，40% 是标注者间也有分歧。\n      κ<0.60 意味着 reviewer 会质疑 task definition 本身的清晰度，以及 gold set 作为 ground truth\n      的可靠性。对 reframed paper，这反而成为正面发现——\"stagnation detection is inherently ambiguous\"\n      是对 task formulation 的重要实证洞见。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Human Annotation Statistics\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Total windows annotated\", \"420\"]\n          - [\"Annotators\", \"3\"]\n          - [\"Fleiss κ\", \"0.52\"]\n          - [\"Unanimous agreement\", \"45%\"]\n          - [\"Majority agreement\", \"68%\"]\n          - [\"Auto MV vs Gold agreement\", \"73%\"]\n          - [\"Annotation time/window\", \"4.2 min\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Disagreement Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Disagreement Type\", \"Count\", \"% of Disagreements\", \"Example Pattern\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Partial progress\", \"58\", \"43%\", \"Some file edits but no test improvement\"]\n          - [\"Exploration vs stagnation\", \"35\", \"26%\", \"Trying different approaches\"]\n          - [\"Outcome-influenced\", \"22\", \"16%\", \"Annotator knowledge of final outcome\"]\n          - [\"Annotation error\", \"20\", \"15%\", \"Missed context / fatigue\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Confusion matrix: auto MV labels vs gold labels\"\n      - \"Bar chart: κ per stagnation sub-type，展示哪些子类型标注一致性最差\"\n    analysis: >\n      κ=0.52 是 worst tier 的重要结果——它说明 stagnation 概念本身在边界处模糊，任何方法的 gold set\n      F1 都有天花板。这解释了为什么 probe、LF oracle、甚至 LLM judge 在 gold set 上都有较大误差。\n      Reframed paper 将此作为 \"task inherent ambiguity\" 的核心发现。\n\n  - name: \"lf-temporal-dynamics\"\n    plan_id: \"lf-temporal-dynamics\"\n    description: \"LF temporal dynamics：哪个 LF 在 stagnation onset 最先亮灯\"\n    expected_results:\n      command_repetition_lead_steps: 1.8\n      output_similarity_lead_steps: 0.5\n      edit_cycle_lead_steps: 0.2\n      outcome_bp_lag_steps: 2.1\n      cmd_rep_is_leading: true\n      outcome_bp_is_lagging: true\n      temporal_correlation_cmd_rep_outcome_bp: 0.38\n      temporal_autocorrelation_lag1_cmd_rep: 0.72\n      temporal_autocorrelation_lag1_outcome_bp: 0.85\n      lf_transition_consistency: 0.61\n    result_rationale: >\n      LF temporal dynamics 分析确认了预期的 leading/lagging 结构：command_repetition 在 stagnation\n      onset 前 ~1.8 steps 就开始触发（leading indicator），而 outcome_bp 在 onset 后 ~2.1 steps\n      才触发（lagging indicator，因为需要看到最终结果才能回传）。这个分析本身是有价值的——但问题在于\n      这个时序结构未能被 temporal label model 有效利用（vs FlyingSquid 无显著差异）。原因分析：\n      LF 的时序自相关很高（cmd_rep lag-1: 0.72, outcome_bp lag-1: 0.85），意味着在 window 级别\n      它们的值变化缓慢，leading/lagging 的差异在 5-step 窗口内被 smoothing 掉。LF 间的 transition\n      consistency 仅 0.61——不够强以支撑可靠的时序标签调整。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LF Temporal Roles\"\n        columns: [\"LF\", \"Lead/Lag (steps)\", \"Role\", \"Autocorrelation (lag-1)\", \"Onset Detection Rate\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"command_repetition\", \"-1.8\", \"Leading\", \"0.72\", \"0.68\"]\n          - [\"output_similarity\", \"-0.5\", \"Concurrent\", \"0.65\", \"0.61\"]\n          - [\"edit_cycle_detection\", \"-0.2\", \"Concurrent\", \"0.58\", \"0.55\"]\n          - [\"outcome_backpropagation\", \"+2.1\", \"Lagging\", \"0.85\", \"0.78\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: 各 LF 在 stagnation onset 前后 [-5, +5] 步窗口内的触发概率曲线\"\n      - \"Cross-correlation heatmap: LF 对之间的时间滞后相关性\"\n    analysis: >\n      Temporal dynamics 分析是 reframed paper 的核心实证贡献之一——即使 temporal label model 未能\n      利用它，这个 characterization 本身对 WS community 有价值。它揭示了 data programming 在\n      sequential data 上的 i.i.d. 假设违反的具体形式：LFs 不是 independent——它们有系统性的时序\n      依赖（leading/lagging），这意味着标准 DP 的条件独立假设在 agent trajectory 上系统性失效。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"2a2c3b6b-be0a-4a84-a4c0-944524ebc718","total_cost_usd":0.63416975,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12805,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":21613,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12805,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":21613,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12805,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12805},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":7773,"outputTokens":22,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.007883000000000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":21613,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":12805,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.62628675,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"2779d2b4-70c7-4bf5-93fa-5698d9fd5eed"}
